(2940077, 412970, 30049, '<td valign="top">Go ahead.  YOU call him a girly man.  :D  Good eye for seeing this in the crowd (well...hard to miss I guess), and then finding a suitable title to fit for the challenge.  I like how you''ve isolated him from the background (long range telephoto?) and the image is quite sharp and well focused.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Go ahead.  YOU call him a girly man.  :D  Good eye for seeing this in the crowd (well...hard to miss I guess), and then finding a suitable title to fit for the challenge.  I like how you''ve isolated him from the background (long range telephoto?) and the image is quite sharp and well focused.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 11:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940081, 413106, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thing that catches my attention is the snow flying.  Second is the tilted horizon.  I really like the vehicles being out there at the time you took this photo as it adds scope/scale to what would otherwise be hard to judge.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'First thing that catches my attention is the snow flying.  Second is the tilted horizon.  I really like the vehicles being out there at the time you took this photo as it adds scope/scale to what would otherwise be hard to judge.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
