(2940253, 411266, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s fun seeing the small flies caught in the web.  :)  As for your spider, I think it''s not focused quite sharp enough and since that''s what your main subject is you could also bring it in substantially closer.  The spider has some excellent color in it that would really pop if this was shot as more of a macro image (and exposure moved up a notch or two).  The background is distracting.  Yes, it''s blurred some by the DOF, but it''s still identifiable and takes the viewer away from the core subject.  Again, a tighter macro type shot would eliminate the unneeded background.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s fun seeing the small flies caught in the web.  :)  As for your spider, I think it''s not focused quite sharp enough and since that''s what your main subject is you could also bring it in substantially closer.  The spider has some excellent color in it that would really pop if this was shot as more of a macro image (and exposure moved up a notch or two).  The background is distracting.  Yes, it''s blurred some by the DOF, but it''s still identifiable and takes the viewer away from the core subject.  Again, a tighter macro type shot would eliminate the unneeded background.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 12:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940267, 411514, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is that really an oxymoron?  Serious, not trying to be a sour puss or anything.  The person is half naked.  Hmmm...I''ll have to go check out that oxymoron link.  :)<br/> <br/>As for the image, it''s composed ok with nice lines moving from the lower left to the upper right.  Lighting could be stronger around the face and shoulders IMO.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Is that really an oxymoron?  Serious, not trying to be a sour puss or anything.  The person is half naked.  Hmmm...I''ll have to go check out that oxymoron link.  :) As for the image, it''s composed ok with nice lines moving from the lower left to the upper right.  Lighting could be stronger around the face and shoulders IMO. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 12:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940273, 413195, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yeah.  I never understood that one.  :)  Interesting photo.  Little bit difficult to know what the frozen part is, but hey, the blue in the flame is sweet!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yeah.  I never understood that one.  :)  Interesting photo.  Little bit difficult to know what the frozen part is, but hey, the blue in the flame is sweet!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 12:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940280, 413211, 30049, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Nice humorous approach and subject.  Big, big shame about his face not being in focus.  Looks like your focus locked in at the neckline of this shirt.  This photo has some potential.  Background could also use a little work, but it''s not the main problem.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Funny.  Nice humorous approach and subject.  Big, big shame about his face not being in focus.  Looks like your focus locked in at the neckline of this shirt.  This photo has some potential.  Background could also use a little work, but it''s not the main problem.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 12:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
