(2940580, 413337, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thing I thought when I saw the thumbnail was this image was going to have some distracting reflections, especially on the larger pot.  Wrong.  Nice job controlling the light here!  I''m not sure why, really, that you used paint.  Non-dairy creamer by itself is a great oxymoron and you could have used the real thing IMO.  Not taking anything away because of your choice, just an observation.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'First thing I thought when I saw the thumbnail was this image was going to have some distracting reflections, especially on the larger pot.  Wrong.  Nice job controlling the light here!  I''m not sure why, really, that you used paint.  Non-dairy creamer by itself is a great oxymoron and you could have used the real thing IMO.  Not taking anything away because of your choice, just an observation.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 13:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
