(2940632, 410629, 30049, '<td valign="top">One shoe on, one off, one leg and hand up, one leg and hand down.  Diagonal lines of the steps coming down and joining the wall.  Many strong factors in here in your composition.  On the down side, I think some additional contrast is needed, crop the right enough to cover the object bottom right corner, and the focus on the man could be sharper.  Maybe a boost in color saturation also.  Nice capture overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'One shoe on, one off, one leg and hand up, one leg and hand down.  Diagonal lines of the steps coming down and joining the wall.  Many strong factors in here in your composition.  On the down side, I think some additional contrast is needed, crop the right enough to cover the object bottom right corner, and the focus on the man could be sharper.  Maybe a boost in color saturation also.  Nice capture overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 14:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940639, 412901, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good oxymoron.  Decent photo.  I like the positioning of the girl in the frame.  Could be a little sharper around her eyes yet.  The yellow blob in the background is <b>extremely</b> distracting.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good oxymoron.  Decent photo.  I like the positioning of the girl in the frame.  Could be a little sharper around her eyes yet.  The yellow blob in the background is extremely distracting. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 14:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940651, 411864, 30049, '<td valign="top">You need a salmon trying to jump the waterfall to add some pop or WOW to this IMO.  Technically it''s ok and it''s a good photo for the oxymoron you''ve selected for the challenge.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'You need a salmon trying to jump the waterfall to add some pop or WOW to this IMO.  Technically it''s ok and it''s a good photo for the oxymoron you''ve selected for the challenge.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940659, 412910, 52549, '<td valign="top">Now that is a cool idea and I really like the way you present the glasses.</td>', 'Now that is a cool idea and I really like the way you present the glasses.', '2006-10-18 14:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940667, 413222, 30049, '<td valign="top">Dying and Life to me symbolizes something human.  I take it your refering to the leaves turning color and dying for the season?  Not sure if the image is a good connection for the oxymoron selected.  However, that said, your image is well put together and has some wonderful color and texture to it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Dying and Life to me symbolizes something human.  I take it your refering to the leaves turning color and dying for the season?  Not sure if the image is a good connection for the oxymoron selected.  However, that said, your image is well put together and has some wonderful color and texture to it.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 14:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940671, 410657, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Good choice for ''Stop Motion''.  Certainly a well used oxymoron in photography.  I like how you''ve put this together in a well balanced image.  Sorry, the hypnosis didn''t work on me however.  :D</td>', 'Cute.  Good choice for ''Stop Motion''.  Certainly a well used oxymoron in photography.  I like how you''ve put this together in a well balanced image.  Sorry, the hypnosis didn''t work on me however.  :D', '2006-10-18 14:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940678, 412703, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a very weird feel to it.  That mouth piece is quite strange!  Funny how much texture there is to a simple t-shirt.  :D  Not really sure if I like the background choice or not.  Maybe if you had a little more distance between you and the wall it would make the background less obvious.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has a very weird feel to it.  That mouth piece is quite strange!  Funny how much texture there is to a simple t-shirt.  :D  Not really sure if I like the background choice or not.  Maybe if you had a little more distance between you and the wall it would make the background less obvious.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940679, 411975, 67278, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I would have liked to seen the shot taken from slightly off to the left of the subject, as opposed to directly behind, to show more of the road.  I think this would take the viewer from the person down the road and exemplify the "nowhere" a bit more.</td>', 'Great image.  I would have liked to seen the shot taken from slightly off to the left of the subject, as opposed to directly behind, to show more of the road.  I think this would take the viewer from the person down the road and exemplify the "nowhere" a bit more.', '2006-10-18 14:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940682, 412823, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and a good idea.</td>', 'Very nice colours and a good idea.', '2006-10-18 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940684, 410753, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, the title suits it perfectly.</td>', 'This is wonderful, the title suits it perfectly.', '2006-10-18 14:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940695, 413016, 63703, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the oxymoron :(</td>', 'I don''t see the oxymoron :(', '2006-10-18 14:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940697, 412613, 63703, '<td valign="top">nice :)</td>', 'nice :)', '2006-10-18 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940700, 413106, 63703, '<td valign="top">very nice :)</td>', 'very nice :)', '2006-10-18 14:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940701, 413217, 63703, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2006-10-18 14:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940704, 412706, 63703, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture, but not quite an oxymoron :)</td>', 'Very interesting picture, but not quite an oxymoron :)', '2006-10-18 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940713, 412008, 56167, '<td valign="top">what a great idea, like the colours and the lighting if you pardon the pun  :-)</td>', 'what a great idea, like the colours and the lighting if you pardon the pun  :-)', '2006-10-18 14:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940715, 412198, 56167, '<td valign="top">well focused like the idea well done</td>', 'well focused like the idea well done', '2006-10-18 14:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940728, 412723, 5354, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what a saltine is, but the image needs something to make it come alive.</td>', 'I have no idea what a saltine is, but the image needs something to make it come alive.', '2006-10-18 14:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940736, 411113, 5354, '<td valign="top">The selective focus on a dictionary definition has been done to death in DPC. This is not exceptional enough to make viewers vote particularly high.</td>', 'The selective focus on a dictionary definition has been done to death in DPC. This is not exceptional enough to make viewers vote particularly high.', '2006-10-18 14:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940737, 413217, 56167, '<td valign="top">like the focus and the composition</td>', 'like the focus and the composition', '2006-10-18 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940739, 411941, 56167, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and focus well done</td>', 'Nice colours and focus well done', '2006-10-18 14:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940745, 412685, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice concept in your image setup overall, however, the focal point is too far forward putting most of the image OOF.  A minor crop in the top left would remove the dark spot (edge of table?).  Very nice exposure and WB control on the rose flower itself.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice concept in your image setup overall, however, the focal point is too far forward putting most of the image OOF.  A minor crop in the top left would remove the dark spot (edge of table?).  Very nice exposure and WB control on the rose flower itself.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 14:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940749, 412139, 63703, '<td valign="top">lol - that''s just a moron, not an oxymoron :)</td>', 'lol - that''s just a moron, not an oxymoron :)', '2006-10-18 14:42:56.000000', NULL, 1);
