(2940766, 412589, 30049, '<td valign="top">The torn hosiery is a nice touch.  Gutsy call on leaving the sun flare in.  I like it, but I imagine you''re going to get called out on it by others.  :D<br/> <br/>This could be VERY enticing if the composition was to exclude the part just above the hill at the end of the visible road.  Just a touch more mystery, that''s all.  But then you would have had to do something about the flare (at the time of image capture).<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The torn hosiery is a nice touch.  Gutsy call on leaving the sun flare in.  I like it, but I imagine you''re going to get called out on it by others.  :D This could be VERY enticing if the composition was to exclude the part just above the hill at the end of the visible road.  Just a touch more mystery, that''s all.  But then you would have had to do something about the flare (at the time of image capture). Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
