(2940966, 411338, 55005, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh... :)</td>', 'This one made me laugh... :)', '2006-10-18 15:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940967, 412955, 55005, '<td valign="top">I loved the idea but in my opinion, it would have been stronger without the scratches (not sure what those line are) in the left corner.</td>', 'I loved the idea but in my opinion, it would have been stronger without the scratches (not sure what those line are) in the left corner.', '2006-10-18 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940978, 412138, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute kid pic.  He looks like a happy camper!  It''s so hard to get a challenge entry photo to do well using the camera''s on-board flash.  It creates heavy shadows in the background.  In this case it may have worked in your favor actually since the kitchen counter and cupboards would be distracting if well lit.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute kid pic.  He looks like a happy camper!  It''s so hard to get a challenge entry photo to do well using the camera''s on-board flash.  It creates heavy shadows in the background.  In this case it may have worked in your favor actually since the kitchen counter and cupboards would be distracting if well lit.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 16:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940982, 413010, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks way over-processed IMO.</td>', 'This looks way over-processed IMO.', '2006-10-18 16:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940985, 412957, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is the best of the bunch I''ve seen yet for ''Silent Scream'' or similar themes.  Very good lighting.  Nice, sharply focused.  Non-obtrusive background.  Something interesting to look at (mouthpiece).  Should do ok with this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is the best of the bunch I''ve seen yet for ''Silent Scream'' or similar themes.  Very good lighting.  Nice, sharply focused.  Non-obtrusive background.  Something interesting to look at (mouthpiece).  Should do ok with this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 16:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940991, 412780, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent way to show this oxymoron.</td>', 'Excellent way to show this oxymoron.', '2006-10-18 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940992, 412729, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good choice of oxymoron for the image, or vice-versa.  :)  I like the image for it''s simple message.  Hoping you don''t get dinged too badly for lighting.  I know the lighting is basically window light that is available and it suits the image, but I think you''re going to be getting some feedback on it being too dark.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good choice of oxymoron for the image, or vice-versa.  :)  I like the image for it''s simple message.  Hoping you don''t get dinged too badly for lighting.  I know the lighting is basically window light that is available and it suits the image, but I think you''re going to be getting some feedback on it being too dark.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 16:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
