(2942375, 410234, 59564, '<td valign="top">I love my macbook pro.  Great photo.</td>', 'I love my macbook pro.  Great photo.', '2006-10-18 23:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942383, 413080, 30049, '<td valign="top">Really.  Either you''re wet, or you''re not.  :)  Image is "ok".  Well focused and exposed properly.  Composition is fine.  Still looks a little like a snapshot.  Stop vehicle.  Get out.  Stand in middle of the road, and take picture.  :D  Perhaps another time of day for more dramatic lighting?  Did you try any shots from a lower or higher elevation?  Guess you''d have to stand on the car for a higher one.  Still...  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really.  Either you''re wet, or you''re not.  :)  Image is "ok".  Well focused and exposed properly.  Composition is fine.  Still looks a little like a snapshot.  Stop vehicle.  Get out.  Stand in middle of the road, and take picture.  :D  Perhaps another time of day for more dramatic lighting?  Did you try any shots from a lower or higher elevation?  Guess you''d have to stand on the car for a higher one.  Still...  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-18 23:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
