(2942883, 413093, 42013, '<td valign="top">I think a little more DOF would have benefited you in this pic. I think it would give a little more meaning and clarity to your title. I do like the gritty feel of the processing as it fits the type of shoe perfectly.</td>', 'I think a little more DOF would have benefited you in this pic. I think it would give a little more meaning and clarity to your title. I do like the gritty feel of the processing as it fits the type of shoe perfectly.', '2006-10-19 02:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942886, 412706, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very creative and a nice presentation as well. It would be nice to see just a little more of the baloon and a different color might have helped as well. The kids are cute, expressions are good as well. Good luck.</td>', 'Very creative and a nice presentation as well. It would be nice to see just a little more of the baloon and a different color might have helped as well. The kids are cute, expressions are good as well. Good luck.', '2006-10-19 02:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942893, 410568, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice greentone and texture on the background. Just right to contrast with the flower and candle. It didn''t need showing fingers there, though...</td>', 'Nice greentone and texture on the background. Just right to contrast with the flower and candle. It didn''t need showing fingers there, though...', '2006-10-19 02:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942895, 412259, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and creative. Should have cleaned the sand dust on the mirror...</td>', 'Nice composition and creative. Should have cleaned the sand dust on the mirror...', '2006-10-19 02:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942897, 411930, 64446, '<td valign="top">I''d say Pretty Awful ;P<br/>Nevertheless, a nice capture with very good contrast.</td>', 'I''d say Pretty Awful ;PNevertheless, a nice capture with very good contrast.', '2006-10-19 02:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942900, 412957, 64446, '<td valign="top">This is so funny and so effective!!!<br/>You silently shouted alout your message! Perfect composition.</td>', 'This is so funny and so effective!!!You silently shouted alout your message! Perfect composition.', '2006-10-19 02:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942911, 412877, 64446, '<td valign="top">Crop is too tight</td>', 'Crop is too tight', '2006-10-19 02:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942924, 413045, 64446, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrati. He is so cute - man, look at those eyes!<br/> I''d title "Awfully Cute" instead.</td>', 'Terrific portrati. He is so cute - man, look at those eyes! I''d title "Awfully Cute" instead.', '2006-10-19 02:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942932, 410619, 60224, '<td valign="top">What am I looking at?</td>', 'What am I looking at?', '2006-10-19 02:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942934, 412685, 17279, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition and execution.  Nice play with colors.  10</td>', 'beautiful composition and execution.  Nice play with colors.  10', '2006-10-19 02:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942936, 412928, 17279, '<td valign="top">nice capture... very emotive and good tie in with the challenge. 10</td>', 'nice capture... very emotive and good tie in with the challenge. 10', '2006-10-19 02:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942938, 413070, 17279, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully emotive image.  Great job with the PP as well... it has a wonderful feel to it.  10</td>', 'A wonderfully emotive image.  Great job with the PP as well... it has a wonderful feel to it.  10', '2006-10-19 03:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
