(2943442, 411244, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections in this image you''ve taken.  Good eye to see it develop and capture it.  May have a little excess space at the bottom, but overll it''s well done.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice use of reflections in this image you''ve taken.  Good eye to see it develop and capture it.  May have a little excess space at the bottom, but overll it''s well done.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 10:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943448, 412053, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool bench!  I''d like one of those.  :D  Ok, serious now.  This is a nice emotive shot that fits the oxymoron theme you''ve selected.  With or without the title, this shot could stand on it''s own merit as a photograph of interest.  That, to me, is substantial.  Only nit is I wish the bench, far left, wasn''t blown out, but that''s minor in the overall scope of things.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a cool bench!  I''d like one of those.  :D  Ok, serious now.  This is a nice emotive shot that fits the oxymoron theme you''ve selected.  With or without the title, this shot could stand on it''s own merit as a photograph of interest.  That, to me, is substantial.  Only nit is I wish the bench, far left, wasn''t blown out, but that''s minor in the overall scope of things.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 10:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943488, 412803, 30049, '<td valign="top">But it IS red.  Isn''t there red licorice and black licorice?  Sorry for missing the oxymoron here.  Guess I''ll have to look it up...  This is an interesting subject to use for an image and has much potential.  The diagonal lines are great, the lighting is a little harsh, and overall it could be sharper (better focused).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'But it IS red.  Isn''t there red licorice and black licorice?  Sorry for missing the oxymoron here.  Guess I''ll have to look it up...  This is an interesting subject to use for an image and has much potential.  The diagonal lines are great, the lighting is a little harsh, and overall it could be sharper (better focused).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 11:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943502, 411893, 30049, '<td valign="top">???  Hmmm.  Perhaps :) or :/  I''ll just settle on interesting and leave it at that.</td>', '???  Hmmm.  Perhaps :) or :/  I''ll just settle on interesting and leave it at that.', '2006-10-19 11:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
