(2943551, 412672, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey.  Almost didn''t see the "second" guy on the right.  :D  Fun image.  Wish it wasn''t so blurry, but it''s still cool.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hey.  Almost didn''t see the "second" guy on the right.  :D  Fun image.  Wish it wasn''t so blurry, but it''s still cool.  Good luck.', '2006-10-19 11:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
