(2943580, 411244, 50695, '<td valign="top">This oxymoron is the perfect conceit for a photograph, and you blend inside and outside very well, both with composition and processing.</td>', 'This oxymoron is the perfect conceit for a photograph, and you blend inside and outside very well, both with composition and processing.', '2006-10-19 11:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943586, 413164, 50695, '<td valign="top">This does look accidental and yet the composition is striking. The perfect photographic oxymoron. I will compliment you by guessing that you are <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48890" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">agenkin</a>. 10</td>', 'This does look accidental and yet the composition is striking. The perfect photographic oxymoron. I will compliment you by guessing that you are  agenkin. 10', '2006-10-19 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943588, 413009, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a metaphor for photography, and also reminscent of the earliest photographs, and it makes me feel like I am inside a camera. This is the clear ribbon winner for me, which means your score is doomed. 10</td>', 'this is a metaphor for photography, and also reminscent of the earliest photographs, and it makes me feel like I am inside a camera. This is the clear ribbon winner for me, which means your score is doomed. 10', '2006-10-19 11:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943593, 412613, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good choice to go B/W to minimize background color distractions.  The tonal range is a little short IMO and contrast could stand a small boost.  Perhaps a trim/crop on the right side to take the deer off-center?<br/> <br/>As for the image, good job getting the photo in the first place.  I imagine there wasn''t a lot of time to react to the situation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good choice to go B/W to minimize background color distractions.  The tonal range is a little short IMO and contrast could stand a small boost.  Perhaps a trim/crop on the right side to take the deer off-center? As for the image, good job getting the photo in the first place.  I imagine there wasn''t a lot of time to react to the situation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 11:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943598, 410657, 60495, '<td valign="top">It almost worked, I got sorta tired and gave you an 8....  Very nice shot I like the way the watch was caught evenly on the two ends to keep it symetrical.</td>', 'It almost worked, I got sorta tired and gave you an 8....  Very nice shot I like the way the watch was caught evenly on the two ends to keep it symetrical.', '2006-10-19 11:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943601, 413129, 30049, '<td valign="top">No fair getting both blanks in one seating!  :)  Clever idea for the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'No fair getting both blanks in one seating!  :)  Clever idea for the challenge.  Good luck!', '2006-10-19 11:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943602, 410879, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is such a photograph. Largely a photo of a clean, manmade locale, it is somehow wild and dangerous, not least of all because of the cat, and how its dark shape seems to be another part of that fencing which has come to life and leaps away. and notice that he moves toward the viewer, making him all the more threatening. Unfortunatlely, the scores here only go up to 10.</td>', 'This is such a photograph. Largely a photo of a clean, manmade locale, it is somehow wild and dangerous, not least of all because of the cat, and how its dark shape seems to be another part of that fencing which has come to life and leaps away. and notice that he moves toward the viewer, making him all the more threatening. Unfortunatlely, the scores here only go up to 10.', '2006-10-19 11:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943603, 412706, 50695, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, fun shot. The off centeredness emphasizes the failure and disappointment of the lead balloon, which makes us laugh. 9</td>', 'Very well composed, fun shot. The off centeredness emphasizes the failure and disappointment of the lead balloon, which makes us laugh. 9', '2006-10-19 11:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943604, 413333, 50695, '<td valign="top">Model and lighting convey seriousness very well. He is holding up that goofy sign os very, very seriously. The best photos in this competition, and there are precious few, convey an oxymoron visually, as you do here.</td>', 'Model and lighting convey seriousness very well. He is holding up that goofy sign os very, very seriously. The best photos in this competition, and there are precious few, convey an oxymoron visually, as you do here.', '2006-10-19 11:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943606, 412613, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, exciting photo. 8</td>', 'Wonderful, exciting photo. 8', '2006-10-19 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943607, 413207, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, did you win?  :D  It was a sure thing right?  He-he.  Very nice job of putting the oxymoron together with an appropriate image.  Finding that not a common circumstance in voting this challenge thus far.<br/> <br/>Very well captured photo.  Nice composition.  I like the shallower DOF.  Well focused with good bright colors and lighting.  I hope you do well with this.  My top pick for the challenge at this point.  Good luck!</td>', 'Well, did you win?  :D  It was a sure thing right?  He-he.  Very nice job of putting the oxymoron together with an appropriate image.  Finding that not a common circumstance in voting this challenge thus far. Very well captured photo.  Nice composition.  I like the shallower DOF.  Well focused with good bright colors and lighting.  I hope you do well with this.  My top pick for the challenge at this point.  Good luck!', '2006-10-19 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943610, 413155, 60495, '<td valign="top">Sweet!   Nicely done, the colors, framing and concept all work, the motion on the sugar makes it a little hard to tell what it is but still a very pleasing image.</td>', 'Sweet!   Nicely done, the colors, framing and concept all work, the motion on the sugar makes it a little hard to tell what it is but still a very pleasing image.', '2006-10-19 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943611, 411265, 50695, '<td valign="top">very clever. you''ve gone beyond the oxymoron here and created a complete paradox: something that is sweet and sorrowful at exactly the same time and place.</td>', 'very clever. you''ve gone beyond the oxymoron here and created a complete paradox: something that is sweet and sorrowful at exactly the same time and place.', '2006-10-19 11:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943614, 410244, 50695, '<td valign="top">great model, nice retro processing, and you convey the title well. We know he is posing but he also seems natural.</td>', 'great model, nice retro processing, and you convey the title well. We know he is posing but he also seems natural.', '2006-10-19 11:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943616, 411270, 50695, '<td valign="top">Interesting, dynamic composition served well by your monotonous processing. :)</td>', 'Interesting, dynamic composition served well by your monotonous processing. :)', '2006-10-19 11:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943618, 412776, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. The figures on the lower right are just as calligraphic as the pictogram on upper left.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. The figures on the lower right are just as calligraphic as the pictogram on upper left.', '2006-10-19 11:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943621, 410445, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the iconic, centered composition and you really do convey the paradox of your title.</td>', 'I like the iconic, centered composition and you really do convey the paradox of your title.', '2006-10-19 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943622, 412321, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I especially like the real versus picture subjects it gives the photo even more interest.</td>', 'Nicely done, I especially like the real versus picture subjects it gives the photo even more interest.', '2006-10-19 11:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943623, 410613, 50695, '<td valign="top">a very touching and vulnerable portrait.</td>', 'a very touching and vulnerable portrait.', '2006-10-19 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943629, 412085, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouetting and the complimentary shapes. They both lean away from each other. The man is such a perfect icon for sorrow. One wonders where the sweetness is, BUT one wonders where the sweetness is in Shakespeare''s original version as well. And I''ll tell you where it is: it exists in the beauty of the sorrow.</td>', 'I like the silhouetting and the complimentary shapes. They both lean away from each other. The man is such a perfect icon for sorrow. One wonders where the sweetness is, BUT one wonders where the sweetness is in Shakespeare''s original version as well. And I''ll tell you where it is: it exists in the beauty of the sorrow.', '2006-10-19 11:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943634, 412598, 60495, '<td valign="top">I like it, you have captured the warrier spirit of this young man, you can just see it in his eyes which are nicely framed in the bow. It would have been really nice to get the shot with out the distraction of the other people.</td>', 'I like it, you have captured the warrier spirit of this young man, you can just see it in his eyes which are nicely framed in the bow. It would have been really nice to get the shot with out the distraction of the other people.', '2006-10-19 11:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943635, 412955, 50695, '<td valign="top">This evokes Dada, Surrealism, and even German Expressionism. Gotta love it!</td>', 'This evokes Dada, Surrealism, and even German Expressionism. Gotta love it!', '2006-10-19 11:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943640, 412901, 60495, '<td valign="top">Overall very nice photo, great subject and pose. The lighting on her is great but the background brightness is a little bit distarcting.</td>', 'Overall very nice photo, great subject and pose. The lighting on her is great but the background brightness is a little bit distarcting.', '2006-10-19 11:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943659, 413045, 66241, '<td valign="top">Amazing!</td>', 'Amazing!', '2006-10-19 11:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943690, 410244, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This looks surreal.  Kind of like cutout art or something.  The hand and face kind of blend some with the background yet the eyes just jump out.  How''d you do that (without selective editing)?  Cool effect (like one of those movies where you see the eyes moving in a painting.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  This looks surreal.  Kind of like cutout art or something.  The hand and face kind of blend some with the background yet the eyes just jump out.  How''d you do that (without selective editing)?  Cool effect (like one of those movies where you see the eyes moving in a painting.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943703, 412910, 59195, '<td valign="top">Very good!  Rates high with me!</td>', 'Very good!  Rates high with me!', '2006-10-19 12:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943736, 413009, 48890, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is a good one.  I have also shot a few shots through the curtain, and I love what you can get as a result. 9</td>', 'Yes, this is a good one.  I have also shot a few shots through the curtain, and I love what you can get as a result. 9', '2006-10-19 12:27:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2943763, 410613, 48890, '<td valign="top">Boy, how to judge this picture?  On the one hand, you have captured some genuine emotion and put a lot of feeling into this photograph.  On the other hand, the picture is so incredibly up-front, with you holding the picture in your hand, and all the pictures in the background, and the composition is so amaturishly centered.  The problem is that I have two forces colliding when looking at it: one force tells me to give a 10 for a *real* photograph of raw emotion, the other tells me to vote down for it being just a snapshot.  I think that I''ll assume that the snapshot feeling to this photograph is intended, and give you a 10, in the end.</td>', 'Boy, how to judge this picture?  On the one hand, you have captured some genuine emotion and put a lot of feeling into this photograph.  On the other hand, the picture is so incredibly up-front, with you holding the picture in your hand, and all the pictures in the background, and the composition is so amaturishly centered.  The problem is that I have two forces colliding when looking at it: one force tells me to give a 10 for a *real* photograph of raw emotion, the other tells me to vote down for it being just a snapshot.  I think that I''ll assume that the snapshot feeling to this photograph is intended, and give you a 10, in the end.', '2006-10-19 12:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943771, 412085, 48890, '<td valign="top">I *do* get a strong feeling of parting in this picture: the similarity between the postures of the man and the tree is very apparent.  I don''t know what to make out of the black stripe in the bottom. 7</td>', 'I *do* get a strong feeling of parting in this picture: the similarity between the postures of the man and the tree is very apparent.  I don''t know what to make out of the black stripe in the bottom. 7', '2006-10-19 12:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943785, 413181, 67334, '<td valign="top">This is what I would hang on my tiki bar.  I love the play on the green and yellow coulours.</td>', 'This is what I would hang on my tiki bar.  I love the play on the green and yellow coulours.', '2006-10-19 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943794, 410356, 48890, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2006-10-19 12:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943801, 412995, 48890, '<td valign="top">The pose is unnatural and the composition is not working: the left part of the frame is much heavier than the right.  I don''t like the all-black background, either. 5</td>', 'The pose is unnatural and the composition is not working: the left part of the frame is much heavier than the right.  I don''t like the all-black background, either. 5', '2006-10-19 12:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943803, 413242, 61155, '<td valign="top">wish my freezer were that clean!! :o)</td>', 'wish my freezer were that clean!! :o)', '2006-10-19 12:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943814, 411893, 61155, '<td valign="top">the secret live of DPC''ers....</td>', 'the secret live of DPC''ers....', '2006-10-19 12:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943819, 410879, 48890, '<td valign="top">This is a weird composition, but I like it.  It feels like hte cat is escaping from the frame. 9</td>', 'This is a weird composition, but I like it.  It feels like hte cat is escaping from the frame. 9', '2006-10-19 12:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943823, 411244, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice layering effect. 9</td>', 'Nice layering effect. 9', '2006-10-19 13:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943827, 412139, 48890, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get grilled for adding text to the image. 6</td>', 'You''ll probably get grilled for adding text to the image. 6', '2006-10-19 13:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943831, 413016, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really related to the challenge I am afraid. Nice picture though.</td>', 'Not really related to the challenge I am afraid. Nice picture though.', '2006-10-19 13:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943842, 411073, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful find and the image is in good shape technically.  I really like the blue sky and clouds in the background.  Nice and simple.  That''s good for this image - anything else would be distracting from the subject.  The one problem I see is the placement of the subject.  Danged if you do, and danged if you don''t I think on this one.  As is, it''s very centered.  Some will like that.  Many won''t I''m afraid.  That cloud in the background...it has a nice diagonal line to it.  If the sign was positioned a little lower (meaning you would have had to elevate yourself), and to the right in relation to that background cloud it would be a stronger presentation IMO.<br/> <br/>Sorry if it sounds like I''m nitpicking, but it''s the minor details that can really move (or lower) a photo in these challenges.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you.</td>', 'Wonderful find and the image is in good shape technically.  I really like the blue sky and clouds in the background.  Nice and simple.  That''s good for this image - anything else would be distracting from the subject.  The one problem I see is the placement of the subject.  Danged if you do, and danged if you don''t I think on this one.  As is, it''s very centered.  Some will like that.  Many won''t I''m afraid.  That cloud in the background...it has a nice diagonal line to it.  If the sign was positioned a little lower (meaning you would have had to elevate yourself), and to the right in relation to that background cloud it would be a stronger presentation IMO. Sorry if it sounds like I''m nitpicking, but it''s the minor details that can really move (or lower) a photo in these challenges. Best of luck to you.', '2006-10-19 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943844, 412589, 48890, '<td valign="top">Acting of the model is very fake here.  I don''t belive this photograph even for a second.</td>', 'Acting of the model is very fake here.  I don''t belive this photograph even for a second.', '2006-10-19 13:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943848, 412926, 48890, '<td valign="top">It looks like the bottles are hanging off a ceiling.  I don''t think that this was intended.</td>', 'It looks like the bottles are hanging off a ceiling.  I don''t think that this was intended.', '2006-10-19 13:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943850, 413164, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not familiar with this as an oxymoron.  Seems more like a mistake, like a hipshot that missed the mark. :D  Oh well, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Not familiar with this as an oxymoron.  Seems more like a mistake, like a hipshot that missed the mark. :D  Oh well, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 13:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943852, 410234, 30049, '<td valign="top">Huh?  Interesting macro shot, but not getting the connection to any oxymoron.  Sorry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Huh?  Interesting macro shot, but not getting the connection to any oxymoron.  Sorry.  Good luck.', '2006-10-19 13:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943859, 413032, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hope you got out of the way when it became a Dynamic Explosion!  :D  The colors are really coming out nice with the overcast sky and your post-processing.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hope you got out of the way when it became a Dynamic Explosion!  :D  The colors are really coming out nice with the overcast sky and your post-processing.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 13:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943861, 412901, 48890, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2006-10-19 13:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943866, 410792, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice expression.  Why the weird prolonged format?</td>', 'Nice expression.  Why the weird prolonged format?', '2006-10-19 13:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943868, 411870, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute take on the challenge.  The image, to me, seems a bit grainy and slightly overexposed on the highlights.  I like the way you''ve framed (composed) it with the dragonfly wings forming a wide, inverted V.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute take on the challenge.  The image, to me, seems a bit grainy and slightly overexposed on the highlights.  I like the way you''ve framed (composed) it with the dragonfly wings forming a wide, inverted V.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 13:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943888, 413093, 48890, '<td valign="top">A pretty shot.  I would turn the camera a little more to the left, to avoid the empty space on the right of the shoe. 8</td>', 'A pretty shot.  I would turn the camera a little more to the left, to avoid the empty space on the right of the shoe. 8', '2006-10-19 13:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943889, 412973, 63269, '<td valign="top">gorgious shot!</td>', 'gorgious shot!', '2006-10-19 13:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943891, 413203, 48890, '<td valign="top">The only successful "alone together" shot in the challenge, and there are many attempts.  The composition is a bit messy, though. 8</td>', 'The only successful "alone together" shot in the challenge, and there are many attempts.  The composition is a bit messy, though. 8', '2006-10-19 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943896, 410244, 48890, '<td valign="top">A pretty portrait. 8</td>', 'A pretty portrait. 8', '2006-10-19 13:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943905, 412982, 48890, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the smudged silhouttes a bit better. A candid shot gets a +1 from me. 8</td>', 'I wish I could see the smudged silhouttes a bit better. A candid shot gets a +1 from me. 8', '2006-10-19 13:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943907, 411871, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice try, but I don''t quite get the feeling that the woman is alone in the crowd.  The other woman on her right seems to be calling her attention, even. Bumping to 7.</td>', 'A nice try, but I don''t quite get the feeling that the woman is alone in the crowd.  The other woman on her right seems to be calling her attention, even. Bumping to 7.', '2006-10-19 13:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943909, 412078, 48890, '<td valign="top">A cute shot. 6</td>', 'A cute shot. 6', '2006-10-19 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944012, 411191, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great tones in this image.  I guess if it''s valuable it shouldn''t be labeled junk - eh?  :D  One mans garbage is another mans treasure!  He-he.  Seriously...nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great tones in this image.  I guess if it''s valuable it shouldn''t be labeled junk - eh?  :D  One mans garbage is another mans treasure!  He-he.  Seriously...nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 13:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944047, 412676, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s certainly alive, for sure!  :D  Some minor issues from where I''m sitting while viewing this photo.  1) Grainy  2) Oversharpened  3) Eye isn''t sharply focused  4) Color feels a little over saturated.  Hopefully you''ll share the original and camera settings for additional feedback after the challenge is over?  Take care.</td>', 'That''s certainly alive, for sure!  :D  Some minor issues from where I''m sitting while viewing this photo.  1) Grainy  2) Oversharpened  3) Eye isn''t sharply focused  4) Color feels a little over saturated.  Hopefully you''ll share the original and camera settings for additional feedback after the challenge is over?  Take care.', '2006-10-19 13:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944059, 412813, 30049, '<td valign="top">Do people really use that phrase?  Calm Stormy...  Hmmm.  Oh well, if they do I guess this image fits.  :D  This is a tough image to comment on.  It''s interesting to look at.  The interest is in the giraffe, but unfortunately the giraffe is underexposed.  Looking at the scene I don''t know how you could add any light without a flash - remote flash maybe?  Probably not.  I would take this image and turn it into a straight silhouette.  I think it would be pretty strong in that format.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Do people really use that phrase?  Calm Stormy...  Hmmm.  Oh well, if they do I guess this image fits.  :D  This is a tough image to comment on.  It''s interesting to look at.  The interest is in the giraffe, but unfortunately the giraffe is underexposed.  Looking at the scene I don''t know how you could add any light without a flash - remote flash maybe?  Probably not.  I would take this image and turn it into a straight silhouette.  I think it would be pretty strong in that format.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944076, 411930, 30049, '<td valign="top">HOW on earth do you get that horse to DO that?!  Is this the same animal that did so well in another fairly recent challenge?  I''ve got the last one flagged as a favorite...hmmm, should go take a peek.  :D<br/> <br/>I think you did a nice job of getting some pretty deep DOF here and keeping a good portion of the horse in focus.  Also a good choice to let the background blowout...it works just fine.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'HOW on earth do you get that horse to DO that?!  Is this the same animal that did so well in another fairly recent challenge?  I''ve got the last one flagged as a favorite...hmmm, should go take a peek.  :D I think you did a nice job of getting some pretty deep DOF here and keeping a good portion of the horse in focus.  Also a good choice to let the background blowout...it works just fine. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 14:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944094, 412628, 30049, '<td valign="top">I get the oxymoron.  Certainly hard to be civil when at war.  The part I''m not getting is the choice of book included in this image.  I guess I automatically think of the ''Civil War'' in the US back in the 1860''s.  Perhaps you''re refering to what''s going on in IRAQ?  Hmmm...<br/> <br/>Anyway.  The image is crystal clear and well put together for the most part.  The newspaper clipping is distracting and don''t see how it adds anything to your composition.  Good control of lighting on the reflective brass shell casings.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I get the oxymoron.  Certainly hard to be civil when at war.  The part I''m not getting is the choice of book included in this image.  I guess I automatically think of the ''Civil War'' in the US back in the 1860''s.  Perhaps you''re refering to what''s going on in IRAQ?  Hmmm... Anyway.  The image is crystal clear and well put together for the most part.  The newspaper clipping is distracting and don''t see how it adds anything to your composition.  Good control of lighting on the reflective brass shell casings. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 14:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944107, 413016, 30049, '<td valign="top">People really say that?  ''Symetrical Birds''?  Hmmm...going to have to look that one up. :D  As for the image.  It''s sharp enough.  Seems underexposed some, although that could be due to the tones, as the image is a little flat.  Needs some levels/curves adjustment and a small shot of contrast to add some extra pop to this photo.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'People really say that?  ''Symetrical Birds''?  Hmmm...going to have to look that one up. :D  As for the image.  It''s sharp enough.  Seems underexposed some, although that could be due to the tones, as the image is a little flat.  Needs some levels/curves adjustment and a small shot of contrast to add some extra pop to this photo.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 14:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944114, 412343, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic and cleverly put together.  I think if they weren''t looking at each other it would be much stronger for the theme/oxymoron you''ve selected.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice scenic and cleverly put together.  I think if they weren''t looking at each other it would be much stronger for the theme/oxymoron you''ve selected. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 14:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944124, 412908, 30049, '<td valign="top">But there IS such a thing as soft focus, as you''ve adeptly illustrated here with this fine photo.  :D  Nice shot overall.  Does seem a bit too yellow to me.  Good luck.</td>', 'But there IS such a thing as soft focus, as you''ve adeptly illustrated here with this fine photo.  :D  Nice shot overall.  Does seem a bit too yellow to me.  Good luck.', '2006-10-19 14:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944178, 411042, 25593, '<td valign="top">My favorite one so far!</td>', 'My favorite one so far!', '2006-10-19 14:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944370, 410753, 30049, '<td valign="top">edit - Oops.  Wrong guess on the photographer I guess.  :D<br/> <br/>I like how the DOF blurs the foreground flower piece (stamen?  can''t remember the flower parts right now) into a nearly translucent state.  This works well as an abstract and the color is fun to look at.<br/> <br/>The part I''m not sure of is the connection to the oxymoron, and my brain hurts from trying to put the connection together!  :)<br/> <br/>Well, at least this got longer than a 2 second look from me anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'edit - Oops.  Wrong guess on the photographer I guess.  :D I like how the DOF blurs the foreground flower piece (stamen?  can''t remember the flower parts right now) into a nearly translucent state.  This works well as an abstract and the color is fun to look at. The part I''m not sure of is the connection to the oxymoron, and my brain hurts from trying to put the connection together!  :) Well, at least this got longer than a 2 second look from me anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-10-19 15:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944373, 412901, 64175, '<td valign="top">Portrait-wise, this is a great photo of the little girl.  The title is appropriate as well.  But the tree on the left is so blown out or bright that it really distracts the viewer from the subject of the picture, the girl. <br/> <br/>Don''t know if these help or not, but I hope they do in some way as I want to leave constructive feedback:<br/>Meets Challenge: 2 <br/>Lighting: 0<br/>Composition: 2<br/>Overall Image: 1 <br/>Wow Factor: 0  (I''m sure the subject is special to you and that is what is important).  <br/> <br/>Score: 5</td>', 'Portrait-wise, this is a great photo of the little girl.  The title is appropriate as well.  But the tree on the left is so blown out or bright that it really distracts the viewer from the subject of the picture, the girl.  Don''t know if these help or not, but I hope they do in some way as I want to leave constructive feedback:Meets Challenge: 2 Lighting: 0Composition: 2Overall Image: 1 Wow Factor: 0  (I''m sure the subject is special to you and that is what is important).   Score: 5', '2006-10-19 15:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
