(2944524, 413010, 50695, '<td valign="top">at first I thought he was holding a stopwatch, and he was timing his watch... which is an amusing idea. But it really doesn''t look like a stopwatch. Perhaps it is some romantic keepsake. So he looks at his watch and it says "now" and he looks at the souvenir and it says "then". Either way, I like it. 8</td>', 'at first I thought he was holding a stopwatch, and he was timing his watch... which is an amusing idea. But it really doesn''t look like a stopwatch. Perhaps it is some romantic keepsake. So he looks at his watch and it says "now" and he looks at the souvenir and it says "then". Either way, I like it. 8', '2006-10-19 16:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
