(2946641, 412612, 50034, '<td valign="top">Better you than me with this photo...I would be accused of making a Lamb (i.e. "lame") Joke!   By the way, since there are no actually sheep in this photo, may I assume that they are <b>"on the lamb"</b>?   :)</td>', 'Better you than me with this photo...I would be accused of making a Lamb (i.e. "lame") Joke!   By the way, since there are no actually sheep in this photo, may I assume that they are "on the lamb"?   :)', '2006-10-20 10:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946648, 412928, 43221, '<td valign="top">powerful image - "free spirit" is not an oxymoron though; unless you believe all spirits are bound by an outside force. ;)</td>', 'powerful image - "free spirit" is not an oxymoron though; unless you believe all spirits are bound by an outside force. ;)', '2006-10-20 10:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946655, 411314, 50034, '<td valign="top">Must be contemplating my joke about the <b>Fender Bender</b> from that other photo!   ;)<br/>   Very creative photo!  You would probably help yourself by starting to watch the issues in the background (usually a weak area for me as well.)  Here the wall seems slanted just a bit to the right.  Easily correctable by watching to make lines parallel with View Finder frame.  It occurs to me that this photo might be taken too close to subject with line slant created by parallax effect.  Try standing farther back and framing in a zoom portrait.  :)</td>', 'Must be contemplating my joke about the Fender Bender from that other photo!   ;)   Very creative photo!  You would probably help yourself by starting to watch the issues in the background (usually a weak area for me as well.)  Here the wall seems slanted just a bit to the right.  Easily correctable by watching to make lines parallel with View Finder frame.  It occurs to me that this photo might be taken too close to subject with line slant created by parallax effect.  Try standing farther back and framing in a zoom portrait.  :)', '2006-10-20 10:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946658, 413070, 58728, '<td valign="top">I hope this ribbons.  It is my favorite of the challenge.  Lovely composition.  I really love the selective desat.  :)  10.</td>', 'I hope this ribbons.  It is my favorite of the challenge.  Lovely composition.  I really love the selective desat.  :)  10.', '2006-10-20 10:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
