(2947164, 413203, 40718, '<td valign="top">fair oxymoron.  The picture is a slice of life type of shot and isn''t bad.  I tend to like these shots better in B&amp;W. 5</td>', 'fair oxymoron.  The picture is a slice of life type of shot and isn''t bad.  I tend to like these shots better in B&W. 5', '2006-10-20 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947170, 413045, 40718, '<td valign="top">good oxymoron, as good an application as I''ve seen for "pretty ugly" in the challenge.  A great shot.  Those eyes are well done and probably the reason you kept it in color.  B&amp;W would have been powerful too. 7</td>', 'good oxymoron, as good an application as I''ve seen for "pretty ugly" in the challenge.  A great shot.  Those eyes are well done and probably the reason you kept it in color.  B&W would have been powerful too. 7', '2006-10-20 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947177, 411514, 40718, '<td valign="top">moderately good oxymoron.  The shot has lighting issues, but I''m not likely to do any better as we both would be using makeshift lights rather than professional ones. 5</td>', 'moderately good oxymoron.  The shot has lighting issues, but I''m not likely to do any better as we both would be using makeshift lights rather than professional ones. 5', '2006-10-20 14:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947182, 411314, 40718, '<td valign="top">moderate oxymoron.  I see how you attempted to combine them in a shot.  it''s quite a bit off kilter, eh?  I''m not sure there''s enough here for the eye to get excited about. 4</td>', 'moderate oxymoron.  I see how you attempted to combine them in a shot.  it''s quite a bit off kilter, eh?  I''m not sure there''s enough here for the eye to get excited about. 4', '2006-10-20 14:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947183, 413285, 40718, '<td valign="top">moderate oxymoron.  The conversion to B&amp;W is pretty good.  I like the tone of the bomb.  composition is decent. 6</td>', 'moderate oxymoron.  The conversion to B&W is pretty good.  I like the tone of the bomb.  composition is decent. 6', '2006-10-20 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947185, 412564, 40718, '<td valign="top">pretty good oxymoron.  The picture is tough though.  It''s not abstract enough to be abstract, but otherwise it''s just a shot of 5 plastic spoons.  5</td>', 'pretty good oxymoron.  The picture is tough though.  It''s not abstract enough to be abstract, but otherwise it''s just a shot of 5 plastic spoons.  5', '2006-10-20 14:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947186, 412823, 40718, '<td valign="top">good oxymoron.  Those dark greens are hard to bring out aren''t they?  Chillis seem made for selective desat.  Composition is good. 6</td>', 'good oxymoron.  Those dark greens are hard to bring out aren''t they?  Chillis seem made for selective desat.  Composition is good. 6', '2006-10-20 14:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947191, 412729, 40718, '<td valign="top">good oxymoron, although it took me a minute to link with the shot (100% chance of rain).  A B&amp;W treatment may have been good here.  composition is good.  lighting is tough.  You want some drab, I guess, to emphasize the emotion the rain is causing, but you don''t want so much that the picture isn''t nice to look at. 6</td>', 'good oxymoron, although it took me a minute to link with the shot (100% chance of rain).  A B&W treatment may have been good here.  composition is good.  lighting is tough.  You want some drab, I guess, to emphasize the emotion the rain is causing, but you don''t want so much that the picture isn''t nice to look at. 6', '2006-10-20 14:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2947230, 413236, 48456, '<td valign="top">should have taken it at a lower angle. stairs are distracting.</td>', 'should have taken it at a lower angle. stairs are distracting.', '2006-10-20 14:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
