(2948562, 412685, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the symbolism here but Im not sure a white rose is an Oxymoron. They have existed naturally for tens of centuries.<br/>I can talk with a little authority about the white roses as they have been my family emblem since the 14th Century, and can be seen 3000 years earlier on frescos dating from the middle of the 16th century BC at Knossos, Crete.<br/> <br/>That being said you have used Dof well to try and draw the eye to the petals, and the balance of colour against the dark leaves, works well.<br/></td>', 'I love the symbolism here but Im not sure a white rose is an Oxymoron. They have existed naturally for tens of centuries.I can talk with a little authority about the white roses as they have been my family emblem since the 14th Century, and can be seen 3000 years earlier on frescos dating from the middle of the 16th century BC at Knossos, Crete. That being said you have used Dof well to try and draw the eye to the petals, and the balance of colour against the dark leaves, works well.', '2006-10-21 05:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
