(2949479, 411918, 60868, '<td valign="top">nice idea<br/>more color would have helped</td>', 'nice ideamore color would have helped', '2006-10-21 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949480, 411244, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and excellent timing on this shot.<br/>Black &amp; white conversion was a good choice too.</td>', 'Well seen and excellent timing on this shot.Black & white conversion was a good choice too.', '2006-10-21 18:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949481, 411571, 60868, '<td valign="top">nice one. how did you make the trails on the sky?</td>', 'nice one. how did you make the trails on the sky?', '2006-10-21 18:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949484, 410344, 19708, '<td valign="top">A few things I see that could have made this better in my opinion:<br/>The dark radius corner in the upper left is a bit of a distraction - a tighter crop would have helped.<br/>There isn''t a strong area in focus. The shell gets close partway up, but still lacking clarity. May have been better to start the sharpness/focus low and graudate out into soft focus.<br/>A dead-center main focal point is a bit iffy in a composition. A different angle or point of view may help in the future.</td>', 'A few things I see that could have made this better in my opinion:The dark radius corner in the upper left is a bit of a distraction - a tighter crop would have helped.There isn''t a strong area in focus. The shell gets close partway up, but still lacking clarity. May have been better to start the sharpness/focus low and graudate out into soft focus.A dead-center main focal point is a bit iffy in a composition. A different angle or point of view may help in the future.', '2006-10-21 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949500, 412653, 60868, '<td valign="top">there are too many elements in the image. It is difficult to focalize on smth</td>', 'there are too many elements in the image. It is difficult to focalize on smth', '2006-10-21 18:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949504, 413155, 67006, '<td valign="top">I''d like to learn how to compose a photo like this!  Really excellent!</td>', 'I''d like to learn how to compose a photo like this!  Really excellent!', '2006-10-21 18:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949507, 412680, 67006, '<td valign="top">I''m looking forward to seeing how this was done--great inspiration for a new photographer such as myself!</td>', 'I''m looking forward to seeing how this was done--great inspiration for a new photographer such as myself!', '2006-10-21 18:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949523, 410619, 67006, '<td valign="top">Fasinating!  I have to learn how to do this!</td>', 'Fasinating!  I have to learn how to do this!', '2006-10-21 18:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949529, 411571, 67006, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me realize how little I know about photography!  Rockin''!</td>', 'This photo makes me realize how little I know about photography!  Rockin''!', '2006-10-21 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949584, 411113, 67006, '<td valign="top">Too much blur, but I like the idea, the caption.</td>', 'Too much blur, but I like the idea, the caption.', '2006-10-21 18:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949593, 411042, 67006, '<td valign="top">Handsome devil....</td>', 'Handsome devil....', '2006-10-21 18:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949595, 413070, 55838, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Back to bump to 8.</td>', 'Lovely.  Back to bump to 8.', '2006-10-21 18:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949601, 412928, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning capture.  Eyes that appear to be longing for freedom.  Great highlights around the eyes abd excellently framed.</td>', 'This is a stunning capture.  Eyes that appear to be longing for freedom.  Great highlights around the eyes abd excellently framed.', '2006-10-21 18:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949955, 411113, 58247, '<td valign="top">Aesthetically I think this is a well done photo. 6<br/> <br/>Politically, it''s a huge slam to those in military around the world putting their ass on the line to defend their country and their fellow citizens.</td>', 'Aesthetically I think this is a well done photo. 6 Politically, it''s a huge slam to those in military around the world putting their ass on the line to defend their country and their fellow citizens.', '2006-10-21 21:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950005, 413304, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - what a trick with the light.  You sure you didn''t want to put that in lighting???  Just astonishing.</td>', 'WOW - what a trick with the light.  You sure you didn''t want to put that in lighting???  Just astonishing.', '2006-10-21 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950239, 412169, 44490, '<td valign="top">The image needs something of interest to focus the viewers attention, how about a flower poking through the snow, or some footprints, or ...</td>', 'The image needs something of interest to focus the viewers attention, how about a flower poking through the snow, or some footprints, or ...', '2006-10-21 23:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950278, 412877, 24495, '<td valign="top">Too tight a composition for my liking.</td>', 'Too tight a composition for my liking.', '2006-10-21 23:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950280, 411113, 53499, '<td valign="top">I Love This Idea!</td>', 'I Love This Idea!', '2006-10-21 23:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950284, 412589, 24495, '<td valign="top">Excellent execution. But the area on the top left is over-exposed. A little more crop would have helped. 7.</td>', 'Excellent execution. But the area on the top left is over-exposed. A little more crop would have helped. 7.', '2006-10-21 23:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950312, 411893, 24495, '<td valign="top">Interesting!</td>', 'Interesting!', '2006-10-21 23:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950560, 412706, 64446, '<td valign="top">Such a creative composition. It is a very pleasing image to watch. I like how the boys look so entertained with the props. What else can I say? One of my favorites here.</td>', 'Such a creative composition. It is a very pleasing image to watch. I like how the boys look so entertained with the props. What else can I say? One of my favorites here.', '2006-10-22 01:35:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2950579, 411338, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, impressive!  I really love the humor here, not to mention that I like this photo technically.</td>', 'Wow, impressive!  I really love the humor here, not to mention that I like this photo technically.', '2006-10-22 01:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950585, 413024, 53316, '<td valign="top">Not sure the photo matches with the text, or I am confused about things.  But in any case, it''s a lovely shot - I especially love the colors and the not-rule-of-thirds composition.</td>', 'Not sure the photo matches with the text, or I am confused about things.  But in any case, it''s a lovely shot - I especially love the colors and the not-rule-of-thirds composition.', '2006-10-22 02:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950587, 412969, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, what an interesting sign! It really has character.</td>', 'Oh wow, what an interesting sign! It really has character.', '2006-10-22 02:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950593, 413255, 53316, '<td valign="top">Not sure you captured the "house" part of things however this is a *stunning* photo!  You managed to make a fly look visually appealing, I think, with the soft background and the colors.  And to make a fly look attractive is no small feat!</td>', 'Not sure you captured the "house" part of things however this is a *stunning* photo!  You managed to make a fly look visually appealing, I think, with the soft background and the colors.  And to make a fly look attractive is no small feat!', '2006-10-22 02:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950596, 411266, 53316, '<td valign="top">Yeeeeep! ..... yeeeeep.  Eeeeeep.<br/>I maybe would have prefered a tighter crop, to have the spider be even more (shudder) prominant.  I like the "pose" of the spider.</td>', 'Yeeeeep! ..... yeeeeep.  Eeeeeep.I maybe would have prefered a tighter crop, to have the spider be even more (shudder) prominant.  I like the "pose" of the spider.', '2006-10-22 02:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950598, 413222, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oooooh.  Fall is my favorite season and you captured it so beautifully!!! Wonderful colors.</td>', 'Oooooh.  Fall is my favorite season and you captured it so beautifully!!! Wonderful colors.', '2006-10-22 02:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950601, 412930, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh man, I just love the composition here.  And I hope people aren''t giving you grief about the "blown highlights" because there isn''t much detail in that area of the penny and the way you have the lighting really sets off the figure on the penny.  Great job.</td>', 'Oh man, I just love the composition here.  And I hope people aren''t giving you grief about the "blown highlights" because there isn''t much detail in that area of the penny and the way you have the lighting really sets off the figure on the penny.  Great job.', '2006-10-22 02:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950605, 412343, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I would have maybe prefered the figure on the left to have a bit of bright clothing too, to add further contrast to the background. Interesting use of the frames.</td>', 'Great concept.  I would have maybe prefered the figure on the left to have a bit of bright clothing too, to add further contrast to the background. Interesting use of the frames.', '2006-10-22 02:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950639, 411338, 49782, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, however I''m not quite sure this counts as an oxymoron...</td>', 'Interesting idea, however I''m not quite sure this counts as an oxymoron...', '2006-10-22 02:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2950804, 412589, 56400, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition but, I think it might have been cropped a little tighter on the left to cut out the discoloration.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition but, I think it might have been cropped a little tighter on the left to cut out the discoloration.', '2006-10-22 06:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951160, 413070, 46870, '<td valign="top">wow great shot ........love this moment ,, 10</td>', 'wow great shot ........love this moment ,, 10', '2006-10-22 11:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951173, 413207, 46870, '<td valign="top">wow geart shot amzinggg colors 9</td>', 'wow geart shot amzinggg colors 9', '2006-10-22 11:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951250, 411648, 58330, '<td valign="top">I like this silhouette, but I think you should have used the full 640 width instead of 500 as it would have given more impact. Good luck. 6</td>', 'I like this silhouette, but I think you should have used the full 640 width instead of 500 as it would have given more impact. Good luck. 6', '2006-10-22 12:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951306, 412947, 58330, '<td valign="top">It looks as if this was taken during the middle part of the day. I wonder what it would have looked like if taken late afternoon or early morning? 6</td>', 'It looks as if this was taken during the middle part of the day. I wonder what it would have looked like if taken late afternoon or early morning? 6', '2006-10-22 13:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951309, 413070, 65603, '<td valign="top">I really just fell for this picture. Great shot!!! Love the way the children stand out but do not take from the picture as a whole great job.</td>', 'I really just fell for this picture. Great shot!!! Love the way the children stand out but do not take from the picture as a whole great job.', '2006-10-22 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951430, 412562, 58330, '<td valign="top">What a good idea for a pic; a bit blurred (which may have been intended, but for me spoils it) and far smaller than you are allowed. Lovely reflections and composure. 6</td>', 'What a good idea for a pic; a bit blurred (which may have been intended, but for me spoils it) and far smaller than you are allowed. Lovely reflections and composure. 6', '2006-10-22 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951453, 411266, 58330, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better if the spider was not so central. Maybe you could have cropped the bottom off and the left, for example, so the spider was in the bottom left of the picture to give a nicer balance. Good picture of the spider, though and good colours. 6</td>', 'I think this would have looked better if the spider was not so central. Maybe you could have cropped the bottom off and the left, for example, so the spider was in the bottom left of the picture to give a nicer balance. Good picture of the spider, though and good colours. 6', '2006-10-22 14:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951467, 411073, 58330, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked good in black and white with a red filter to define the cloud better and with the sign away from the centre of your picture. 5</td>', 'I think this would have looked good in black and white with a red filter to define the cloud better and with the sign away from the centre of your picture. 5', '2006-10-22 14:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951478, 413070, 66840, '<td valign="top">this picture is beautiful!!</td>', 'this picture is beautiful!!', '2006-10-22 14:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951480, 412053, 58330, '<td valign="top">The left of the bench as we look and the blouse are a bit blown out, but a nice range of pure black to white. Otherwise a lovely mood which pulls at the heart strings. 7</td>', 'The left of the bench as we look and the blouse are a bit blown out, but a nice range of pure black to white. Otherwise a lovely mood which pulls at the heart strings. 7', '2006-10-22 14:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951481, 411941, 66840, '<td valign="top">i like this picture alot.. however i wonder how the picture would have looked with the candies upright.. i''m guessing you may have tried it... 8 from me on this picture..</td>', 'i like this picture alot.. however i wonder how the picture would have looked with the candies upright.. i''m guessing you may have tried it... 8 from me on this picture..', '2006-10-22 14:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951485, 411338, 66840, '<td valign="top">this is by far the best i''ve seen to really tell of an oxymoron..  10</td>', 'this is by far the best i''ve seen to really tell of an oxymoron..  10', '2006-10-22 14:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951489, 413222, 66840, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure how this portreys and oxymoron in the picture itself... the title is the only thing telling me this is an oxymoron.. without looking at the title.. i would not guess this is fitting the challenge.. however the picture is beautiful in itself and i will score in 2 parts... meets the challenge.. and quality of picture.. <br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'i''m not sure how this portreys and oxymoron in the picture itself... the title is the only thing telling me this is an oxymoron.. without looking at the title.. i would not guess this is fitting the challenge.. however the picture is beautiful in itself and i will score in 2 parts... meets the challenge.. and quality of picture..  Good luck', '2006-10-22 14:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951492, 412723, 66840, '<td valign="top">however i do see 3 specks of salt on the front cracker... not sure if anyone else noticed this..   good luck!</td>', 'however i do see 3 specks of salt on the front cracker... not sure if anyone else noticed this..   good luck!', '2006-10-22 15:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951496, 411162, 66840, '<td valign="top">i would have liked to see this picture more sharp.. .the back ground color is not flattering.. you should have gone with something else.. not sure off the top.. but maybe a yellow... also the horizon is crooked... i do like this picture otherwise though.. the idea of the picture.. and even possibly a different angle.. like looking up from the bottom of the glasses... just my idea.. lol</td>', 'i would have liked to see this picture more sharp.. .the back ground color is not flattering.. you should have gone with something else.. not sure off the top.. but maybe a yellow... also the horizon is crooked... i do like this picture otherwise though.. the idea of the picture.. and even possibly a different angle.. like looking up from the bottom of the glasses... just my idea.. lol', '2006-10-22 15:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951578, 412955, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  There''s just too much distraction to work through to get to the subject.</td>', 'Nice idea.  There''s just too much distraction to work through to get to the subject.', '2006-10-22 15:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951647, 412769, 67115, '<td valign="top">I like the unique topic. The celebrating figure is great, shadows in good places; but I feel as if there needs to be more for the blue part. Irrelivant, the best so far - 9</td>', 'I like the unique topic. The celebrating figure is great, shadows in good places; but I feel as if there needs to be more for the blue part. Irrelivant, the best so far - 9', '2006-10-22 16:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951650, 412589, 67115, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting and composition. The model is also displaying good emotions. Very nice work!</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting and composition. The model is also displaying good emotions. Very nice work!', '2006-10-22 16:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951652, 412205, 67115, '<td valign="top">Nice twist to the oxymoron. 10 just for the imaginativeness.</td>', 'Nice twist to the oxymoron. 10 just for the imaginativeness.', '2006-10-22 16:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951653, 412676, 63944, '<td valign="top">It is a bit grainy, but a great shot!</td>', 'It is a bit grainy, but a great shot!', '2006-10-22 16:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951667, 411073, 67115, '<td valign="top">Good find! An unusual ''oxymoron''.</td>', 'Good find! An unusual ''oxymoron''.', '2006-10-22 17:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951670, 413333, 67115, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, both in background/foreground brightness and in topic. That man is very serious!</td>', 'Nice contrast, both in background/foreground brightness and in topic. That man is very serious!', '2006-10-22 17:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951673, 412085, 67115, '<td valign="top">I like the strong emotion given off by this photo. Nice colours aswell.</td>', 'I like the strong emotion given off by this photo. Nice colours aswell.', '2006-10-22 17:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951678, 412612, 67115, '<td valign="top">Ha! Yeah, those lambs are very dangerous. Good composition and background colours. I like the outdoor feel this picture has with it, possibly due to the fog and the rain on the sign. Well done!</td>', 'Ha! Yeah, those lambs are very dangerous. Good composition and background colours. I like the outdoor feel this picture has with it, possibly due to the fog and the rain on the sign. Well done!', '2006-10-22 17:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951681, 412776, 67115, '<td valign="top">I like your subject choice. Good framing, breaking up the monotone background with the poster. Good shutter speed too, it just feels exactly balanced between control and chaos. Good work!</td>', 'I like your subject choice. Good framing, breaking up the monotone background with the poster. Good shutter speed too, it just feels exactly balanced between control and chaos. Good work!', '2006-10-22 17:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951689, 413203, 67115, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Very chaotic, but so organised too. You eyes are immediately taken to the only man looking at you.</td>', 'Good shot. Very chaotic, but so organised too. You eyes are immediately taken to the only man looking at you.', '2006-10-22 17:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951692, 413106, 67115, '<td valign="top">A different take on the oxymoron theme. Good frame.</td>', 'A different take on the oxymoron theme. Good frame.', '2006-10-22 17:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951748, 413045, 35602, '<td valign="top">Definitely an oxymoron, but this kid is not ugly.  Really cute.  The dirty face is just so endearing, and those eyes are awesome.  Gonna be a heartbreaker.</td>', 'Definitely an oxymoron, but this kid is not ugly.  Really cute.  The dirty face is just so endearing, and those eyes are awesome.  Gonna be a heartbreaker.', '2006-10-22 18:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951780, 412078, 35602, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe this guy was just napping on the job.  Very cute.  Doens''t seem to really be an oxymoron, though.  Anyway, some things that bother me about the image is the belly of the seal looks odd.  It seems like it is a shirt or something, which of course it can''t be.  The white buoy and sail seem almost too white for the darker highlights of the seal.  It was a neat capture, though.  Can''t say as I have ever seen such a unique  moment.</td>', 'Can''t believe this guy was just napping on the job.  Very cute.  Doens''t seem to really be an oxymoron, though.  Anyway, some things that bother me about the image is the belly of the seal looks odd.  It seems like it is a shirt or something, which of course it can''t be.  The white buoy and sail seem almost too white for the darker highlights of the seal.  It was a neat capture, though.  Can''t say as I have ever seen such a unique  moment.', '2006-10-22 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951804, 413337, 35602, '<td valign="top">Lovely tonal quality on this one.  Why did you use the paint, though?  Not sure why it is there.  Anyway, the metal shine is well done, not too overexposed, and your darks to lights are well done.</td>', 'Lovely tonal quality on this one.  Why did you use the paint, though?  Not sure why it is there.  Anyway, the metal shine is well done, not too overexposed, and your darks to lights are well done.', '2006-10-22 18:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951812, 412332, 35602, '<td valign="top">Like the concept.  Great dark background to highlight the red of the berries.  Could have used a different lighting.  Perhaps a bit more from underneath?  I have actually used a sheet of glass propped on a couple of chairs with a transparent fabric over the glass, then used just a 25 or 40 watt bulb from below facing up, to get some more highlights.</td>', 'Like the concept.  Great dark background to highlight the red of the berries.  Could have used a different lighting.  Perhaps a bit more from underneath?  I have actually used a sheet of glass propped on a couple of chairs with a transparent fabric over the glass, then used just a 25 or 40 watt bulb from below facing up, to get some more highlights.', '2006-10-22 18:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951822, 413203, 35602, '<td valign="top">The color balance seems to be off.  Maybe a bit too much green or cyan?</td>', 'The color balance seems to be off.  Maybe a bit too much green or cyan?', '2006-10-22 18:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951831, 412400, 31403, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I''m looking at - color might help</td>', 'I don''t know what I''m looking at - color might help', '2006-10-22 18:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2951833, 412598, 35602, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of the boy and the arrows.  I think the background boy in red may be a bit distracting, though.  I know you need to capture the moment when you can, but I do like the out of focus of the lower left person in the blue hat.  Too bad that right person snuck in while you were shooting.</td>', 'I really like the composition of the boy and the arrows.  I think the background boy in red may be a bit distracting, though.  I know you need to capture the moment when you can, but I do like the out of focus of the lower left person in the blue hat.  Too bad that right person snuck in while you were shooting.', '2006-10-22 18:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952113, 411244, 60068, '<td valign="top">great shot I really love the play with reflections.</td>', 'great shot I really love the play with reflections.', '2006-10-22 21:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952226, 412910, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way the shadow sorta forms a nose.</td>', 'I like the way the shadow sorta forms a nose.', '2006-10-22 21:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952227, 412169, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kind of a plain picture but a very good take on the challenge!</td>', 'Kind of a plain picture but a very good take on the challenge!', '2006-10-22 22:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952242, 412930, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well, I see the abundant part.  Where''s the poverty?</td>', 'Well, I see the abundant part.  Where''s the poverty?', '2006-10-22 22:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952245, 413211, 54446, '<td valign="top">dnmc 1</td>', 'dnmc 1', '2006-10-22 22:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952254, 410754, 54446, '<td valign="top">Okay, your title would be an oxymoron.  Where''s the modern part?</td>', 'Okay, your title would be an oxymoron.  Where''s the modern part?', '2006-10-22 22:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952259, 413203, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb!  An outstanding comment on our society.  Hope this one ribbons.  10</td>', 'Superb!  An outstanding comment on our society.  Hope this one ribbons.  10', '2006-10-22 22:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952264, 413171, 54446, '<td valign="top">Truly an oxymoron!!!!!! 10</td>', 'Truly an oxymoron!!!!!! 10', '2006-10-22 22:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952280, 413016, 54446, '<td valign="top">dnmc and poor spelling.  Cute photo.  How is this an oxymoron?</td>', 'dnmc and poor spelling.  Cute photo.  How is this an oxymoron?', '2006-10-22 22:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952283, 412053, 54728, '<td valign="top">I like it! Conveys a strong mood and story.  A little overexposed on the end of the bench.</td>', 'I like it! Conveys a strong mood and story.  A little overexposed on the end of the bench.', '2006-10-22 22:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952287, 412598, 54728, '<td valign="top">Wow, strong image.  Love the expression on their faces.  Good composition and interesting bokeh.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow, strong image.  Love the expression on their faces.  Good composition and interesting bokeh.  Well done!', '2006-10-22 22:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952290, 412729, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo and overall feeling, good composition and lighting.  While I''d prefer to see a little more face, there is just enough eye to satisfy.  I love it, and hope that it does well.</td>', 'Lovely photo and overall feeling, good composition and lighting.  While I''d prefer to see a little more face, there is just enough eye to satisfy.  I love it, and hope that it does well.', '2006-10-22 22:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952292, 412589, 44490, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose, interesting lighting, good exposure and composition.  I''m ambivalent about the flare and torn hose, and think that it would look better without these somewhat distracting features, at least the color streak.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Excellent pose, interesting lighting, good exposure and composition.  I''m ambivalent about the flare and torn hose, and think that it would look better without these somewhat distracting features, at least the color streak.  Hope it does well.', '2006-10-22 22:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952294, 411930, 44490, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh and smile.  I like this "Awfully Pretty."  Great capture of the moment, good composition, etc.  Hope it does as well as awfully pretty can.</td>', 'Made me laugh and smile.  I like this "Awfully Pretty."  Great capture of the moment, good composition, etc.  Hope it does as well as awfully pretty can.', '2006-10-22 22:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952295, 413045, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, absolutely striking eyes.  Poignant, and I hope that it does well.</td>', 'Nice composition, absolutely striking eyes.  Poignant, and I hope that it does well.', '2006-10-22 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952297, 413337, 44490, '<td valign="top">Yuk, I hope that you didn''t serve that to your guests!  Nice idea, composition, interesting lighting, good humor, I like it.</td>', 'Yuk, I hope that you didn''t serve that to your guests!  Nice idea, composition, interesting lighting, good humor, I like it.', '2006-10-22 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952299, 411893, 44490, '<td valign="top">Strong idea, good execution, composition, lighting, DOF.  (Manual) focus on eye would be better, as the towel stands out a little too sharply / too much.</td>', 'Strong idea, good execution, composition, lighting, DOF.  (Manual) focus on eye would be better, as the towel stands out a little too sharply / too much.', '2006-10-22 22:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952300, 412564, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, arrangement, lighting, execution.  Elegant and beautiful.</td>', 'Nice idea, arrangement, lighting, execution.  Elegant and beautiful.', '2006-10-22 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952304, 413207, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautifully clean, brightly illuminated, nice nail polish, composition, focus, and DOF.  I''d prefer betting on a pair of queens, e.g., queen of spades plus queen of hearts, but I like the image.</td>', 'Beautifully clean, brightly illuminated, nice nail polish, composition, focus, and DOF.  I''d prefer betting on a pair of queens, e.g., queen of spades plus queen of hearts, but I like the image.', '2006-10-22 22:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952306, 411191, 44490, '<td valign="top">Strong image, nicely executed color processing, just wish that you could reduce the residual color in the background.  Reminds me of the old days of hand coloring B&amp;W prints.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Strong image, nicely executed color processing, just wish that you could reduce the residual color in the background.  Reminds me of the old days of hand coloring B&W prints.  Nicely done.', '2006-10-22 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952308, 412672, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, pretty well executed.  The watch is a little distracting, and I''m debating whether two different people would be better, but I like concept and think that you probably had fun doing it.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, pretty well executed.  The watch is a little distracting, and I''m debating whether two different people would be better, but I like concept and think that you probably had fun doing it.', '2006-10-22 22:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952309, 412672, 54728, '<td valign="top">I''m very impressed.  Very eerie photo... I guess it''s a double exposure? It turned out very well!</td>', 'I''m very impressed.  Very eerie photo... I guess it''s a double exposure? It turned out very well!', '2006-10-22 22:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952310, 412680, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, lighting, refraction, overall execution.  Too bad the flame is blown out, a smoother gradation would be really good.  I think that a stronger colored candle would also help.</td>', 'Nice idea, lighting, refraction, overall execution.  Too bad the flame is blown out, a smoother gradation would be really good.  I think that a stronger colored candle would also help.', '2006-10-22 22:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952311, 412970, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice color, contrast, black mask/makeup, bokeh, and meeting of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice color, contrast, black mask/makeup, bokeh, and meeting of the challenge.', '2006-10-22 22:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952313, 411244, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting capture of the juxtaposed people.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting capture of the juxtaposed people.', '2006-10-22 22:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952314, 413333, 54728, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2006-10-22 22:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952316, 412957, 44490, '<td valign="top">Strong idea and prop use.  I''d prefer less direct lighting with key light from the side, but this lighting actually seems to work for this title and idea.  Even disturbing as intended, it is striking.</td>', 'Strong idea and prop use.  I''d prefer less direct lighting with key light from the side, but this lighting actually seems to work for this title and idea.  Even disturbing as intended, it is striking.', '2006-10-22 22:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952317, 412499, 44490, '<td valign="top">What a sight - a tractor in downtown Seattle!  Thanks for the snapshot and the smile.</td>', 'What a sight - a tractor in downtown Seattle!  Thanks for the snapshot and the smile.', '2006-10-22 22:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952318, 413129, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wha? Ha!  Nice idea and execution, now if you could only hit the triple word score.</td>', 'Wha? Ha!  Nice idea and execution, now if you could only hit the triple word score.', '2006-10-22 22:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952321, 412685, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, setup, composition, focus, and DOF.  The leaves at top are unnecessary, and the stem doesn''t line up, but theses are nits.  I''m not sure that I like the desaturation, I''d think that the white rose would be more striking in contrast to more vibrant colors, especially if it were the only white.</td>', 'Nice idea, setup, composition, focus, and DOF.  The leaves at top are unnecessary, and the stem doesn''t line up, but theses are nits.  I''m not sure that I like the desaturation, I''d think that the white rose would be more striking in contrast to more vibrant colors, especially if it were the only white.', '2006-10-22 22:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952325, 410657, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''m guessing that it took multiple attempts to get this the way that you wanted.  I hope that you are rewarded for the effort.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''m guessing that it took multiple attempts to get this the way that you wanted.  I hope that you are rewarded for the effort.', '2006-10-22 22:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952332, 412346, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, colors, flame, and mist.  A touch brighter would probably be better, bump saturation to maintain color intensity.</td>', 'Nice idea, colors, flame, and mist.  A touch brighter would probably be better, bump saturation to maintain color intensity.', '2006-10-22 22:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952333, 412823, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, colors, composition, and lighting - classic in style, a touch  more sharpness and DOF might be better.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, colors, composition, and lighting - classic in style, a touch  more sharpness and DOF might be better.', '2006-10-22 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952335, 412750, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, composition, reflection, classical.  The stray small reflections(?) on the left are a little distracting and confusing.</td>', 'Nice colors, composition, reflection, classical.  The stray small reflections(?) on the left are a little distracting and confusing.', '2006-10-22 22:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952336, 410879, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting walkway, lines, and perspective.  High contrast probably works for the high contrast challenge, for here, I''d prefer to see more midtones and detail, and the right paw that looks cut off.</td>', 'Interesting walkway, lines, and perspective.  High contrast probably works for the high contrast challenge, for here, I''d prefer to see more midtones and detail, and the right paw that looks cut off.', '2006-10-22 22:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952338, 412789, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, focus, DOF.  Adding a Jim Beam bottle might give a needed object of focus, or fill one of the front shot glasses with Jim Beam...</td>', 'Nice effect, focus, DOF.  Adding a Jim Beam bottle might give a needed object of focus, or fill one of the front shot glasses with Jim Beam...', '2006-10-22 22:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952342, 411338, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, arrangement, props, including bottle.  Surrealistic, and it grew on me at the second viewing - bumping up.</td>', 'Nice idea, arrangement, props, including bottle.  Surrealistic, and it grew on me at the second viewing - bumping up.', '2006-10-22 22:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952345, 412085, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colors, clouds, pose, interesting silhouette.  Maybe the other person or a gravestone would help to reinforce the parting so that it isn''t just someone walking with a bowed head?  And the clouds at his feet make it seem like a composite rather than a mountain top.  Still has a nice feel.</td>', 'Nice composition, colors, clouds, pose, interesting silhouette.  Maybe the other person or a gravestone would help to reinforce the parting so that it isn''t just someone walking with a bowed head?  And the clouds at his feet make it seem like a composite rather than a mountain top.  Still has a nice feel.', '2006-10-22 22:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952346, 413286, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  A white dress would be better to match the white angel wings.  A tighter crop would reduce the seeming clutter of the smaller rocks in the foreground and would be more effective.</td>', 'Nice idea.  A white dress would be better to match the white angel wings.  A tighter crop would reduce the seeming clutter of the smaller rocks in the foreground and would be more effective.', '2006-10-22 22:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952349, 412729, 54728, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection of her tiara in the window.</td>', 'Love the reflection of her tiara in the window.', '2006-10-22 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952353, 412957, 54728, '<td valign="top">wow!  interesting image!</td>', 'wow!  interesting image!', '2006-10-22 22:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952355, 412613, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a moment.  Unfortunately, outside is what we want to see, and it is overexposed and washed out.  Consider revisiting levels for a full range outside, ignoring the inside, maybe even crop to the grid in the door.</td>', 'Nice capture of a moment.  Unfortunately, outside is what we want to see, and it is overexposed and washed out.  Consider revisiting levels for a full range outside, ignoring the inside, maybe even crop to the grid in the door.', '2006-10-22 22:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952369, 413255, 54728, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I am so impressed!  I would instantly favourite this if I wasn''t totally creeped out by that fly.  You''ve got mad photography skills to do this...amazing!</td>', 'Wow!  I am so impressed!  I would instantly favourite this if I wasn''t totally creeped out by that fly.  You''ve got mad photography skills to do this...amazing!', '2006-10-22 22:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952370, 410870, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, colors, composition, lighting, DOF, should emote a chuckle or groan from most people.  Hope you didn''t squish this bug. ;-)</td>', 'Nice idea, colors, composition, lighting, DOF, should emote a chuckle or groan from most people.  Hope you didn''t squish this bug. ;-)', '2006-10-22 22:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952372, 413171, 54728, '<td valign="top">Cute!  nice focus and cool background.</td>', 'Cute!  nice focus and cool background.', '2006-10-22 22:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952379, 412998, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting growth of mushrooms, nice composition, shapes, and colors.  Mushrooms seem too soft, I''m wishing for more sharpness and DOF at least some detail can be seen in the caps.</td>', 'Interesting growth of mushrooms, nice composition, shapes, and colors.  Mushrooms seem too soft, I''m wishing for more sharpness and DOF at least some detail can be seen in the caps.', '2006-10-22 22:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952380, 412813, 44490, '<td valign="top">There is calm/stormy as antonyms - haven''t heard of "calm stormy" as an oxymoron, but I''ll give you the benefit of a doubt.  Interesting skies.  A full silhouette would probably be better, crank the black level to get it and check it out.</td>', 'There is calm/stormy as antonyms - haven''t heard of "calm stormy" as an oxymoron, but I''ll give you the benefit of a doubt.  Interesting skies.  A full silhouette would probably be better, crank the black level to get it and check it out.', '2006-10-22 22:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952389, 412927, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, nice composition, leading line of stem, boke.  Wish for a touch more DOF and saturation, although the pastel feel matches my kitchen wall.  Interesting and lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful image, nice composition, leading line of stem, boke.  Wish for a touch more DOF and saturation, although the pastel feel matches my kitchen wall.  Interesting and lovely.', '2006-10-22 22:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952394, 412910, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and shadows, in fact, I think that you could have done more with the shadows, and wonder what you could have done with colored lighting.</td>', 'Interesting lines and shadows, in fact, I think that you could have done more with the shadows, and wonder what you could have done with colored lighting.', '2006-10-22 23:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952397, 413171, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great setup, expressions, pose, and foam.  Softer light and slightly less light would probably be better.</td>', 'Great setup, expressions, pose, and foam.  Softer light and slightly less light would probably be better.', '2006-10-22 23:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952398, 413204, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, was that bird half-peacock, and half-...  More visible cat would be better, with more lighting, eye-contact, bigger, less distracting background.  Hope others catch the idea.</td>', 'Nice idea, was that bird half-peacock, and half-...  More visible cat would be better, with more lighting, eye-contact, bigger, less distracting background.  Hope others catch the idea.', '2006-10-22 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952405, 410753, 44490, '<td valign="top">Fitting title, I''m confused, since only small portions of the image are clear.  Strawberries, cream, and cake?  I''d be interested in seeing a clearer outtake.</td>', 'Fitting title, I''m confused, since only small portions of the image are clear.  Strawberries, cream, and cake?  I''d be interested in seeing a clearer outtake.', '2006-10-22 23:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952406, 411265, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, composition, lighting.  Nuttily creative.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, composition, lighting.  Nuttily creative.', '2006-10-22 23:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952408, 412259, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.  Cleaner mirror would probably be better as the doubled-dots spoil the illusion a bit.  But that''s a beautifully dry martini!</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.  Cleaner mirror would probably be better as the doubled-dots spoil the illusion a bit.  But that''s a beautifully dry martini!', '2006-10-22 23:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952413, 412928, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Powerful eyes and for once, a way to work in the usually annoying chain-link fence.  Strong statement, strong work, hope that people caught it all, and that it does well.  Love it.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Powerful eyes and for once, a way to work in the usually annoying chain-link fence.  Strong statement, strong work, hope that people caught it all, and that it does well.  Love it.', '2006-10-22 23:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952421, 413002, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and colors.  Only a small portion of the image is bright and sharp, leaving an overall impression of softness, darkness, and lack of detail.  More DOF and more even illumination would help.</td>', 'Nice lines and colors.  Only a small portion of the image is bright and sharp, leaving an overall impression of softness, darkness, and lack of detail.  More DOF and more even illumination would help.', '2006-10-22 23:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952423, 411571, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting image, poignant feeling.  More stars would probably help.  I''m interested in the exposure and setting details.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting image, poignant feeling.  More stars would probably help.  I''m interested in the exposure and setting details.', '2006-10-22 23:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952424, 411865, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, leading lines, interesting subject.</td>', 'Nice colors, leading lines, interesting subject.', '2006-10-22 23:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952425, 410568, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice pastels.  Candle shots are a challenge, as you want to feature the candle, yet have your subject(s) well lit.  I think that you choose pretty well for DPC, the colors and bokeh are very nice.</td>', 'Nice idea, nice pastels.  Candle shots are a challenge, as you want to feature the candle, yet have your subject(s) well lit.  I think that you choose pretty well for DPC, the colors and bokeh are very nice.', '2006-10-22 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952427, 411319, 44490, '<td valign="top">I sure hope that it washes off/out.  Extra point for courage.</td>', 'I sure hope that it washes off/out.  Extra point for courage.', '2006-10-22 23:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952428, 413110, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, colors, and overall feel.  I wish for at least a pair of eyes peeking around the wing, I think that would really make the shot.  The lighting and shadows are a bit hard, looks like a single flash on camera left.  Try pulling the subject further away from the backdrop and use dual key plus fill lighting with big diffusers/umbrellas/softboxes.</td>', 'Nice idea, colors, and overall feel.  I wish for at least a pair of eyes peeking around the wing, I think that would really make the shot.  The lighting and shadows are a bit hard, looks like a single flash on camera left.  Try pulling the subject further away from the backdrop and use dual key plus fill lighting with big diffusers/umbrellas/softboxes.', '2006-10-22 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952434, 412008, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great fire and color gradients.  I think that lighting the bottle from behind/inside would really add to the shot.</td>', 'Nice composition, great fire and color gradients.  I think that lighting the bottle from behind/inside would really add to the shot.', '2006-10-22 23:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952440, 413322, 44490, '<td valign="top">While the lighting is interesting, more balance lighting between the two peppers would probably be better.  A trip to the store on the day of the shoot, and careful produce selection would help.</td>', 'While the lighting is interesting, more balance lighting between the two peppers would probably be better.  A trip to the store on the day of the shoot, and careful produce selection would help.', '2006-10-22 23:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952442, 412472, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright.  Less straight-on perspective and composition would be more interesting.  Also the doubled-reflection from the mirror is annoying, consider using a polished black marble tile (available at Home Depot) for reflections at low angles.</td>', 'Nice and bright.  Less straight-on perspective and composition would be more interesting.  Also the doubled-reflection from the mirror is annoying, consider using a polished black marble tile (available at Home Depot) for reflections at low angles.', '2006-10-22 23:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952443, 412901, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute child, nice boke in background.  The lighting is too harsh and direct, try diffusers with key light on side plus fill.</td>', 'Cute child, nice boke in background.  The lighting is too harsh and direct, try diffusers with key light on side plus fill.', '2006-10-22 23:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952445, 413106, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but what are those white spots -- is it snowing?  The image seems overexposed, consider rescuing it with levels, and bumping up saturation.</td>', 'Nice composition, but what are those white spots -- is it snowing?  The image seems overexposed, consider rescuing it with levels, and bumping up saturation.', '2006-10-22 23:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952446, 413333, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Lighting from below is a good choice for this oxymoron, but I think that light on the person would be better, rather than the wall behind the left hand.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Lighting from below is a good choice for this oxymoron, but I think that light on the person would be better, rather than the wall behind the left hand.', '2006-10-22 23:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952448, 410754, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lighting, capture of the patina of rust and weathering.  But where''s the modern component?  If the bolt were pushed through a shiny new eyelet, that might make the connection?</td>', 'Nice composition, lighting, capture of the patina of rust and weathering.  But where''s the modern component?  If the bolt were pushed through a shiny new eyelet, that might make the connection?', '2006-10-22 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952449, 413200, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but how about something more, like popping the key tops and spelling something that''s also an oxymoron?</td>', 'Nice composition, but how about something more, like popping the key tops and spelling something that''s also an oxymoron?', '2006-10-22 23:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952450, 413181, 44490, '<td valign="top">Not a bad combo.  However I think that you went to far with the color/hue adjustments, it would probably be better if there were a full range with a bit of real white somewhere.</td>', 'Not a bad combo.  However I think that you went to far with the color/hue adjustments, it would probably be better if there were a full range with a bit of real white somewhere.', '2006-10-22 23:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952453, 411871, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, but the overall image seems too low-key, and the cup is brightly distracting.  Might have been better to try isolation by DOF, and put your levels and constrast back to where there is some definition of the coat from the bench, etc.</td>', 'Nice pose, but the overall image seems too low-key, and the cup is brightly distracting.  Might have been better to try isolation by DOF, and put your levels and constrast back to where there is some definition of the coat from the bench, etc.', '2006-10-22 23:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952454, 412803, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but a somewhat difficult subject.  My guess is that your light is too hard, consider softer light, e.g., using a reflector/diffuser, and more DOF.</td>', 'Good idea, but a somewhat difficult subject.  My guess is that your light is too hard, consider softer light, e.g., using a reflector/diffuser, and more DOF.', '2006-10-22 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952455, 410613, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nicely emotive, catches the feeling of sorrow.  Key light to the side would probably be better than straight on.  Also, fewer photos / less-busy would probably do better in DPC, providing less distraction from the main subject.</td>', 'Nicely emotive, catches the feeling of sorrow.  Key light to the side would probably be better than straight on.  Also, fewer photos / less-busy would probably do better in DPC, providing less distraction from the main subject.', '2006-10-22 23:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952456, 411870, 44490, '<td valign="top">I''m feeling dense looking for the oxymoron - maybe my "soft side" might be an oxymoron for a "dragon"fly?  Nice macro, including eyes would be better.</td>', 'I''m feeling dense looking for the oxymoron - maybe my "soft side" might be an oxymoron for a "dragon"fly?  Nice macro, including eyes would be better.', '2006-10-22 23:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952457, 412877, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute miniature horse.  The crop seems a bit tight, I think that you have other/better composition choices with the original.  Also interaction with a person, child, carrot, apple, etc. would add a nice needed element and tell a story.</td>', 'Cute miniature horse.  The crop seems a bit tight, I think that you have other/better composition choices with the original.  Also interaction with a person, child, carrot, apple, etc. would add a nice needed element and tell a story.', '2006-10-22 23:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952458, 411864, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  A little more angle would probably be better, as it is, the photo seems cut in two vertically.</td>', 'Nice idea.  A little more angle would probably be better, as it is, the photo seems cut in two vertically.', '2006-10-22 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952476, 413058, 44490, '<td valign="top">Delicated --&gt; delicate?  Nice idea.  Larger image would be better, see the tutorial on preparing your images for DPC.  Better focus/sharpness and softer lighting would help, consider using a diffuser of some kind.</td>', 'Delicated --> delicate?  Nice idea.  Larger image would be better, see the tutorial on preparing your images for DPC.  Better focus/sharpness and softer lighting would help, consider using a diffuser of some kind.', '2006-10-22 23:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952477, 411918, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Is the main subject supposed to be Yogi or the ghost?  Some additional separation would clarify, although color separation with Yogi might be a challenge.  The background seems to suffer from oversharpening / overprocessing, try moving the figures further away from the background for some DOF separation.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Is the main subject supposed to be Yogi or the ghost?  Some additional separation would clarify, although color separation with Yogi might be a challenge.  The background seems to suffer from oversharpening / overprocessing, try moving the figures further away from the background for some DOF separation.', '2006-10-22 23:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952479, 412776, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice oxymoron.  Capturing action in poor lighting indoor is a challenge.  I think that this image would be better with less motion blur - try bumping up ISO, opening aperture all the way, and faster shutter speed.</td>', 'Nice oxymoron.  Capturing action in poor lighting indoor is a challenge.  I think that this image would be better with less motion blur - try bumping up ISO, opening aperture all the way, and faster shutter speed.', '2006-10-22 23:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952480, 413255, 44490, '<td valign="top">Focus is OK, just needs more DOF.</td>', 'Focus is OK, just needs more DOF.', '2006-10-22 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952482, 413123, 44490, '<td valign="top">Too bad, the chain-link fence just kills this image, and the main cat subject is underexposed.  Did you try going as close to the fence as possible with your lens wide open?  With a moderately fast lens, the fence will "magically" disappear (except in the highlights, although you will suffer some loss of contrast and clarity).</td>', 'Too bad, the chain-link fence just kills this image, and the main cat subject is underexposed.  Did you try going as close to the fence as possible with your lens wide open?  With a moderately fast lens, the fence will "magically" disappear (except in the highlights, although you will suffer some loss of contrast and clarity).', '2006-10-22 23:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952498, 412903, 24495, '<td valign="top">8.</td>', '8.', '2006-10-22 23:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952504, 411918, 24495, '<td valign="top">Which one is alone? Perhaps differential focusing would had helped!</td>', 'Which one is alone? Perhaps differential focusing would had helped!', '2006-10-22 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952563, 412672, 64315, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE!</td>', 'VERY NICE!', '2006-10-23 00:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952570, 412908, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and nice soft feeling to match.  Love the ethereal feel of the horse, brush, and trees.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Nice idea, and nice soft feeling to match.  Love the ethereal feel of the horse, brush, and trees.  Hope it does well.', '2006-10-23 00:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952574, 413070, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, poses, composition, colors, sharpness, and DOF.  Leg tucked in might be better, but that''s a nit.  I love the feeling of family, sharing, belonging...</td>', 'Lovely idea, poses, composition, colors, sharpness, and DOF.  Leg tucked in might be better, but that''s a nit.  I love the feeling of family, sharing, belonging...', '2006-10-23 00:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952575, 412078, 44490, '<td valign="top">Too funny!  Nice composition, sharpness, clean, "full" lines.  Made me smile, hope it does well.</td>', 'Too funny!  Nice composition, sharpness, clean, "full" lines.  Made me smile, hope it does well.', '2006-10-23 00:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952576, 412706, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.  The twins and the props are great.  Wish you had shot with larger aperture and less DOF to blur out the background.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.  The twins and the props are great.  Wish you had shot with larger aperture and less DOF to blur out the background.', '2006-10-23 00:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952580, 412878, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, poses, B&amp;W choice.  Better focus and sharpness on faces would help, and the white socks distract from the faces.  Lower perspective might also be more dramatic.</td>', 'Nice idea, poses, B&W choice.  Better focus and sharpness on faces would help, and the white socks distract from the faces.  Lower perspective might also be more dramatic.', '2006-10-23 00:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952659, 413082, 52854, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and I like the photo. Wish it showed more.</td>', 'I like the idea and I like the photo. Wish it showed more.', '2006-10-23 00:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952669, 412706, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the facial expressions! Creative photo - nicely done!</td>', 'Great shot. Love the facial expressions! Creative photo - nicely done!', '2006-10-23 00:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2953046, 412672, 60354, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is some great work! Excellent!</td>', 'Wow, this is some great work! Excellent!', '2006-10-23 01:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2953055, 413070, 60354, '<td valign="top">Great work!!</td>', 'Great work!!', '2006-10-23 01:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2953082, 413045, 36619, '<td valign="top">i really don''t think your title fits this photo at all. there is nothing ugly about this child. dirty perhaps, but most children get that way at times...</td>', 'i really don''t think your title fits this photo at all. there is nothing ugly about this child. dirty perhaps, but most children get that way at times...', '2006-10-23 01:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2953138, 413070, 40490, '<td valign="top">how did you get the softness in the clothing and rock?  I really like it and it doesn''t seem natural</td>', 'how did you get the softness in the clothing and rock?  I really like it and it doesn''t seem natural', '2006-10-23 02:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2953192, 410445, 66910, '<td valign="top">All I can really say is wow. Great lighting, focus, texture and overal creativity. Job well done!</td>', 'All I can really say is wow. Great lighting, focus, texture and overal creativity. Job well done!', '2006-10-23 02:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2953733, 412672, 3569, '<td valign="top">Hi Jack, you are living :)  Hi Sammie too.  Great and different shot for you.  Van</td>', 'Hi Jack, you are living :)  Hi Sammie too.  Great and different shot for you.  Van', '2006-10-23 09:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954277, 412562, 65723, '<td valign="top">Lol,<br/>Took me awhile to figure out what I was looking at.  Hit me all at once..., Well Done.</td>', 'Lol,Took me awhile to figure out what I was looking at.  Hit me all at once..., Well Done.', '2006-10-23 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954306, 413002, 65723, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many times I''ve actually heard that.... (probably a lot)<br/>Great Oxy, Great Photo.</td>', 'I wonder how many times I''ve actually heard that.... (probably a lot)Great Oxy, Great Photo.', '2006-10-23 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954472, 413045, 52132, '<td valign="top">I like to oxymoron, but I think the child is still beautiful.</td>', 'I like to oxymoron, but I think the child is still beautiful.', '2006-10-23 13:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954569, 413045, 18073, '<td valign="top">Wow, now thats a powerful image, I would love to beleive this is a staged photo, but I have a horrible feeling that the child is living in these conditions.  Great compositions and a real tear jerking expression.<br/> <br/>Great image, and I feel it fits the challenge well too, good luck with this one!</td>', 'Wow, now thats a powerful image, I would love to beleive this is a staged photo, but I have a horrible feeling that the child is living in these conditions.  Great compositions and a real tear jerking expression. Great image, and I feel it fits the challenge well too, good luck with this one!', '2006-10-23 14:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954775, 412769, 52449, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. I would have liked to see this when the sun at a lower position.</td>', 'Very nice composition. I would have liked to see this when the sun at a lower position.', '2006-10-23 15:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954776, 412947, 52449, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and the repeating shapes at the top.</td>', 'I like the crop and the repeating shapes at the top.', '2006-10-23 15:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954782, 413171, 31443, '<td valign="top">Cheeky, love that look!</td>', 'Cheeky, love that look!', '2006-10-23 15:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
