(2954831, 412672, 58025, '<td valign="top">SHOULD HAVE HAD A DIFFERENT PERSON BY THE OTHER TOMBSTONE, OTHER THAN THAT LOOKS GOOD TO ME!<br/> <br/>PHOTO WATCHER</td>', 'SHOULD HAVE HAD A DIFFERENT PERSON BY THE OTHER TOMBSTONE, OTHER THAN THAT LOOKS GOOD TO ME! PHOTO WATCHER', '2006-10-23 15:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955178, 412564, 65723, '<td valign="top">Wicked Photo.... Double Oxy too ! I''d be surprised if it wasn''t top 3.<br/>Really well done.</td>', 'Wicked Photo.... Double Oxy too ! I''d be surprised if it wasn''t top 3.Really well done.', '2006-10-23 17:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955317, 410619, 35708, '<td valign="top">Interesting but there doesn''t seem to be enough to tell what this is.</td>', 'Interesting but there doesn''t seem to be enough to tell what this is.', '2006-10-23 18:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955319, 413171, 35708, '<td valign="top">Great! A little more shadows on the subject and it''d be really great.</td>', 'Great! A little more shadows on the subject and it''d be really great.', '2006-10-23 18:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955323, 412628, 35708, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. I would have put more light on the shell casings and polished them up a little more though. It would give it a bit of a highlight or ''edge'' to make them stand out in a ''harder'' way.</td>', 'Very cool idea. I would have put more light on the shell casings and polished them up a little more though. It would give it a bit of a highlight or ''edge'' to make them stand out in a ''harder'' way.', '2006-10-23 18:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955324, 411073, 35708, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Great way to capture this.</td>', 'Awesome. Great way to capture this.', '2006-10-23 18:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955335, 410754, 35708, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... never heard the term modern antique before. Regardless, the border is way too big BUT I do like it. Maybe half the size of that would be much better. Cool shot.</td>', 'Hmmm... never heard the term modern antique before. Regardless, the border is way too big BUT I do like it. Maybe half the size of that would be much better. Cool shot.', '2006-10-23 18:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955339, 411162, 35708, '<td valign="top">Not an oxymoron. Also, the lack of lighting makes this pretty bland. Due to glare it would be tough to light this... But if you could tape some white LED''s behind the glasses to make the liquid ''glow'' it could be a cool effect.</td>', 'Not an oxymoron. Also, the lack of lighting makes this pretty bland. Due to glare it would be tough to light this... But if you could tape some white LED''s behind the glasses to make the liquid ''glow'' it could be a cool effect.', '2006-10-23 18:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955359, 411930, 35708, '<td valign="top">Amazingly good photo! Good composition and color. Funny! The weeds in the background are a little distracting but I dont think it hurts the picture. Great one!</td>', 'Amazingly good photo! Good composition and color. Funny! The weeds in the background are a little distracting but I dont think it hurts the picture. Great one!', '2006-10-23 18:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955362, 413045, 35708, '<td valign="top">Nicely done... I wouldn''t say ''ugly'' but ''rough'' for sure. But I think it is good enough to meet the challenge. :) Nice shot though... I like this. Great all around.</td>', 'Nicely done... I wouldn''t say ''ugly'' but ''rough'' for sure. But I think it is good enough to meet the challenge. :) Nice shot though... I like this. Great all around.', '2006-10-23 18:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955370, 413129, 35708, '<td valign="top">Holy cow, you did it. Creative, great comp, great DOF.... this is it! You got it. *10*</td>', 'Holy cow, you did it. Creative, great comp, great DOF.... this is it! You got it. *10*', '2006-10-23 18:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2955378, 412927, 35708, '<td valign="top">You''re really stretching the challenge.. almost a DNMC. The border is highly distracting. A 2 or 3 pixel line just inside of the edge would have been better if you really had to have one.</td>', 'You''re really stretching the challenge.. almost a DNMC. The border is highly distracting. A 2 or 3 pixel line just inside of the edge would have been better if you really had to have one.', '2006-10-23 18:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
