(2957273, 411073, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, clever idea. I think an off-center sign, taken at an angle, would be more dynamic.</td>', 'Nice sky, clever idea. I think an off-center sign, taken at an angle, would be more dynamic.', '2006-10-24 11:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
