(2957358, 412910, 12733, '<td valign="top">Definitely an oxymoron, and good use of high key. But the glasses themselves don''t make for an interesting subject.</td>', 'Definitely an oxymoron, and good use of high key. But the glasses themselves don''t make for an interesting subject.', '2006-10-24 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
