(2958820, 412396, 37629, '<td valign="top">a Very stunning and beautiful macro. The focus seems to be on his pincers whereas being on it''s head would be much nicer. I don''t understand the white line to the left of the shot. The composition is interesting and I like it. In a weird way this is very nicely balanced. I like the oxymoron in the title, I can see how it would relate to the image but it would have been nicer if there were something like two mantis'' one grooming like this one, and the other with a fly. so ill give you 2.5/5 for relating to the challenge.</td>', 'a Very stunning and beautiful macro. The focus seems to be on his pincers whereas being on it''s head would be much nicer. I don''t understand the white line to the left of the shot. The composition is interesting and I like it. In a weird way this is very nicely balanced. I like the oxymoron in the title, I can see how it would relate to the image but it would have been nicer if there were something like two mantis'' one grooming like this one, and the other with a fly. so ill give you 2.5/5 for relating to the challenge.', '2006-10-24 21:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958826, 413106, 37629, '<td valign="top">Sorry, no oxymoron here. At least from the title and the photo, not one that pops out. The horizon of the photo is slanted, and the picture is a bit bright, i would have turned down the brightness a tad and upped the contrast. Maybe used a faster shutter speed, the blur on the snowflakes is good, but the blades and even shaft of the structure seem a little blurred (shutter speed probably could''ve helped with the brightness too.</td>', 'Sorry, no oxymoron here. At least from the title and the photo, not one that pops out. The horizon of the photo is slanted, and the picture is a bit bright, i would have turned down the brightness a tad and upped the contrast. Maybe used a faster shutter speed, the blur on the snowflakes is good, but the blades and even shaft of the structure seem a little blurred (shutter speed probably could''ve helped with the brightness too.', '2006-10-24 21:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958829, 412138, 37629, '<td valign="top">Great Title. Makes for a good oxymoron. However, I really don''t see it in your photo. It''s lacking in clarity and isn''t really interesting. Composition seems good, and he has a cute smile. but the photo doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Great Title. Makes for a good oxymoron. However, I really don''t see it in your photo. It''s lacking in clarity and isn''t really interesting. Composition seems good, and he has a cute smile. but the photo doesn''t do it for me.', '2006-10-24 21:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958830, 410356, 37629, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I think just having the white around the border would be sufficient. The title and oxymoron make me laugh, reminds me of Calvin and Hobbes. I like this :-)</td>', 'Great photo. I think just having the white around the border would be sufficient. The title and oxymoron make me laugh, reminds me of Calvin and Hobbes. I like this :-)', '2006-10-24 22:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958837, 411265, 37629, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity. The face is composed nicely, has the right expression the photo needs, I enjoy how subtle it is. Without the title though, it doesn''t really relate. I don''t know what those nuts (assuming they are nuts) are, and I''m not sure whether they are sweet or not. The background needs to be cleaned up a bit, there are little black specks all over, and I would have used a surface without any texture or detail on it, just a flat white surface. Overall, its ok i guess. :p :-)</td>', 'I like the simplicity. The face is composed nicely, has the right expression the photo needs, I enjoy how subtle it is. Without the title though, it doesn''t really relate. I don''t know what those nuts (assuming they are nuts) are, and I''m not sure whether they are sweet or not. The background needs to be cleaned up a bit, there are little black specks all over, and I would have used a surface without any texture or detail on it, just a flat white surface. Overall, its ok i guess. :p :-)', '2006-10-24 22:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958838, 411244, 37629, '<td valign="top">I really do love this. Amazing use of reflections here, really gives a great allusion, nice use of black and white as well. A bit grainy but it makes for a very interesting shot</td>', 'I really do love this. Amazing use of reflections here, really gives a great allusion, nice use of black and white as well. A bit grainy but it makes for a very interesting shot', '2006-10-24 22:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958847, 410870, 67551, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words to come up with a good oxy-moron. Good picture too.</td>', 'Nice play on words to come up with a good oxy-moron. Good picture too.', '2006-10-24 22:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958855, 413203, 37629, '<td valign="top">Great concept for a title. I do not like how there isn''t a focus on the people who are alone together, not many will assume that the title has to do with the whole section of the subway full of people. <br/>The photo is way to busy, the focus is all over the place, but my eye is mostly drawn to the man with the hat, which makes for the interesting concept of him being in his own place all by himself. The photo is a bit boring and looks like a point and shoot situation. It''s a bit pasty, and if you don''t already, I would suggest editing your pic BEFORE resizing it. Overall not a very good shot though.</td>', 'Great concept for a title. I do not like how there isn''t a focus on the people who are alone together, not many will assume that the title has to do with the whole section of the subway full of people. The photo is way to busy, the focus is all over the place, but my eye is mostly drawn to the man with the hat, which makes for the interesting concept of him being in his own place all by himself. The photo is a bit boring and looks like a point and shoot situation. It''s a bit pasty, and if you don''t already, I would suggest editing your pic BEFORE resizing it. Overall not a very good shot though.', '2006-10-24 22:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958857, 412998, 67006, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful!  Deep rich colors make me want to go out for a walk...</td>', 'Simply beautiful!  Deep rich colors make me want to go out for a walk...', '2006-10-24 22:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958859, 413009, 67006, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  I really like this idea and composition!  Inspirational!</td>', 'Very interesting!  I really like this idea and composition!  Inspirational!', '2006-10-24 22:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958861, 411191, 67006, '<td valign="top">I''m new to DP and the DPChallenge, but this photo really appeals to me.  Excellent composition, interesting colorization, lots to hold your gaze, an excellent photo.  I rate it high!</td>', 'I''m new to DP and the DPChallenge, but this photo really appeals to me.  Excellent composition, interesting colorization, lots to hold your gaze, an excellent photo.  I rate it high!', '2006-10-24 22:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958862, 411266, 67006, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great inspiration for a newbie, like myself--thanks!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great inspiration for a newbie, like myself--thanks!', '2006-10-24 22:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958867, 412957, 37629, '<td valign="top">WOW! I didn''t see the zipper mouth at all in the thumbnail, frankly it changed my whole view of this photo. The hair is really well done, along with the hand gesture and facial expression, It makes it look like a speaker is being blown behind her. Zipper mouth makes a great metaphor and its a good oxymoron. I think you cropped it a little close to the head, I would have left much more of a background and had more clarity in the shot.</td>', 'WOW! I didn''t see the zipper mouth at all in the thumbnail, frankly it changed my whole view of this photo. The hair is really well done, along with the hand gesture and facial expression, It makes it look like a speaker is being blown behind her. Zipper mouth makes a great metaphor and its a good oxymoron. I think you cropped it a little close to the head, I would have left much more of a background and had more clarity in the shot.', '2006-10-24 22:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958877, 410344, 37629, '<td valign="top">Interesting Idea. I see the firepower (assuming its a bullet) but not the peace. cool perspective. The whole of the shot is kind of blurry, even the base of the bullet which seems to be the focus. the horizontal line is slanted, I would have straightened it out. Kind of a boring pic though.</td>', 'Interesting Idea. I see the firepower (assuming its a bullet) but not the peace. cool perspective. The whole of the shot is kind of blurry, even the base of the bullet which seems to be the focus. the horizontal line is slanted, I would have straightened it out. Kind of a boring pic though.', '2006-10-24 22:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958880, 413255, 37629, '<td valign="top">Great macro. Lovely Soft focus. I don''t like your concept of oxymoron and the pic doesn''t relate. But besides that, I like this photo lots!</td>', 'Great macro. Lovely Soft focus. I don''t like your concept of oxymoron and the pic doesn''t relate. But besides that, I like this photo lots!', '2006-10-24 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
