(2958933, 413304, 37629, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get the oxymoron. the photo is lacking clarity, and the background is a bit weird, by that i mean there is to much light on the background under her arm and not enough around the rest. the lighting is a bit to intense on the one side of her and i would have used a softbox to light her darkerside slightly</td>', 'I don''t really get the oxymoron. the photo is lacking clarity, and the background is a bit weird, by that i mean there is to much light on the background under her arm and not enough around the rest. the lighting is a bit to intense on the one side of her and i would have used a softbox to light her darkerside slightly', '2006-10-24 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
