(2960286, 413203, 60614, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say I gave you a 10 for this shot.  I really felt this one should have done better.   My eyes are drawn to the guy in the middle but then they roam and you see how everyone is alone in the crowd.  I like how you had most everyone in focus.  The lighting was pretty good also.  I can''t think of anything I would change.  You seized the moment and that is what it is all about.  I would love to get a shot like this someday.  Great job.</td>', 'Just wanted to say I gave you a 10 for this shot.  I really felt this one should have done better.   My eyes are drawn to the guy in the middle but then they roam and you see how everyone is alone in the crowd.  I like how you had most everyone in focus.  The lighting was pretty good also.  I can''t think of anything I would change.  You seized the moment and that is what it is all about.  I would love to get a shot like this someday.  Great job.', '2006-10-25 07:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
