(2960683, 411042, 30608, '<td valign="top">When you get right down to it, there were 110 people who didn''t have a clue when it came to voting on this. This is way above an "Average" "5" photograph. The majority of the voters got it right, and you still came in in a very good position at #24. Good job Sandy!</td>', 'When you get right down to it, there were 110 people who didn''t have a clue when it came to voting on this. This is way above an "Average" "5" photograph. The majority of the voters got it right, and you still came in in a very good position at #24. Good job Sandy!', '2006-10-25 09:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
