(2961219, 412472, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 20 and a new personal best!   I voted this a 7. :)  I thought it was a great oxymoron and a cool picture.<br/> <br/>The reflection looks fine to me, but if you want to try a perfectly clean reflection in the future, try to get a mirror with the reflecting material on the front.  I''ve heard they''re more expensive, though.<br/> <br/>I agree with the folks about the textured background, but it''s a minor thing.  I use different-colored posterboard.  You can also just set it up in a dark room far from any walls.<br/> <br/>I think you''ll get a 6+ shot soon. :)</td>', 'Congrats on the top 20 and a new personal best!   I voted this a 7. :)  I thought it was a great oxymoron and a cool picture. The reflection looks fine to me, but if you want to try a perfectly clean reflection in the future, try to get a mirror with the reflecting material on the front.  I''ve heard they''re more expensive, though. I agree with the folks about the textured background, but it''s a minor thing.  I use different-colored posterboard.  You can also just set it up in a dark room far from any walls. I think you''ll get a 6+ shot soon. :)', '2006-10-25 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961223, 412706, 28532, '<td valign="top">This is sooooo awesome!!!! Congrates on the blue!!</td>', 'This is sooooo awesome!!!! Congrates on the blue!!', '2006-10-25 11:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
