(2961497, 412706, 19672, '<td valign="top">So funny, congrats on the ribbon.<br/> <br/>Very fun creative idea per usual.  I saw it and said "Bet it is Scalvert". Just goes to show even with new models your style shines thru.  <br/> <br/>That said, it''s cause lbs for lbs you enter more creative shots than any one photographer. And if anyone thinks that''s a bad thing...they''re crazy!<br/> <br/>I think you should print out all your whimsical humorous shots and display them at a gallery somewhere. I think people would get a great kick out of it all.</td>', 'So funny, congrats on the ribbon. Very fun creative idea per usual.  I saw it and said "Bet it is Scalvert". Just goes to show even with new models your style shines thru.   That said, it''s cause lbs for lbs you enter more creative shots than any one photographer. And if anyone thinks that''s a bad thing...they''re crazy! I think you should print out all your whimsical humorous shots and display them at a gallery somewhere. I think people would get a great kick out of it all.', '2006-10-25 13:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961503, 413070, 19672, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it?</td>', 'I don''t get it?', '2006-10-25 13:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961505, 412343, 19672, '<td valign="top">Well, I think this one should have done better. I much prefer both the concept and the capture to the "Timeless Moment" 2nd place ribbon.<br/> <br/>Go figure...</td>', 'Well, I think this one should have done better. I much prefer both the concept and the capture to the "Timeless Moment" 2nd place ribbon. Go figure...', '2006-10-25 13:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
