(2961518, 413070, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Well done on the result.  I notice all your winning images are shot in a high ISO mode.  You must have to be careful with the noise issue.  This one looks like it was processed using strong noise reduction software at a fairly aggressive setting.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Well done on the result.  I notice all your winning images are shot in a high ISO mode.  You must have to be careful with the noise issue.  This one looks like it was processed using strong noise reduction software at a fairly aggressive setting.', '2006-10-25 13:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961538, 411191, 60495, '<td valign="top">Thanks Sandy, I was really surprised it got into the top 10 but I am glad so many people liked it. I give the tractor most of the credit, then of course my son for some of his processing advice, I only take credit for getting up early to take the picture...lol</td>', 'Thanks Sandy, I was really surprised it got into the top 10 but I am glad so many people liked it. I give the tractor most of the credit, then of course my son for some of his processing advice, I only take credit for getting up early to take the picture...lol', '2006-10-25 13:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
