(2980236, 411571, 43340, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this was an extension of a stage and the guy was performing some type of act (e.g., comedy).  I thought that it captures well the reaction and isolation of a performer who is just not connecting with his audience.  I thought that this is truly when you really do hear the "sound of silence" and it can be deafening.<br/> <br/>However, I think your photo has a similar theme and even though the person on the end of the pier isn''t performing for an audience, he is hearing the "sound of silence."<br/> <br/>Congrats and great job!<br/> <br/></td>', 'At first glance I thought this was an extension of a stage and the guy was performing some type of act (e.g., comedy).  I thought that it captures well the reaction and isolation of a performer who is just not connecting with his audience.  I thought that this is truly when you really do hear the "sound of silence" and it can be deafening. However, I think your photo has a similar theme and even though the person on the end of the pier isn''t performing for an audience, he is hearing the "sound of silence." Congrats and great job! ', '2006-10-31 22:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
